{"folder":"9LJujCqZ6IrLO0Ai","name":"Black Opal","type":"loot","_id":"0BIXYULR7r7Uguhv","img":"icons/commodities/gems/pearl-black.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"0BIXYULR7r7Uguhv\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Black Opal</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A dark opal whose surface breaks into green, blue, and ember-red fire when turned.</p><p>Merchants know stones like this need only a moment in the light before the buyer starts inventing reasons to want them.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 1,000 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Black Opal</strong></p><p>A dark opal whose surface breaks into green, blue, and ember-red fire when turned. Merchants know stones like this need only a moment in the light before the buyer starts invent...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1000,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"identifier":"black-opal","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"0BIXYULR7r7Uguhv\"><p><em>A cut stone awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This cut stone is described by faceted surfaces and reflected light. Small details imply more value than a quick glance can confirm.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Cut Stone</li><li>Inspection cues: faceted surfaces and reflected light</li><li>Identific