{"folder":"W0I33XtZCMuVhQH6","name":"Starburst Pendant","type":"loot","_id":"2jOOF2gOl9oNwEgT","img":"icons/equipment/neck/pendant-faceted-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"2jOOF2gOl9oNwEgT\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Starburst Pendant</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A pendant worked into a radiating starburst around a small central stone.</p><p>It has the bright confidence of jewelry made to catch candlelight across a hall and make the wearer easier to remember.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure, Jewelry</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 300 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Starburst Pendant</strong></p><p>A pendant worked into a radiating starburst around a small central stone. It has the bright confidence of jewelry made to catch candlelight across a hall and make the wearer eas...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":300,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"identifier":"starburst-pendant","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"2jOOF2gOl9oNwEgT\"><p><em>A jewelry awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This jewelry is described by faceted surfaces and reflected light. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Jew