{"folder":"9LJujCqZ6IrLO0Ai","name":"Emerald","type":"loot","_id":"2q1Cvb7GDga4dq13","img":"icons/commodities/gems/gem-oval-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"2q1Cvb7GDga4dq13\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Emerald</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A rich green emerald with small internal threads that prove it is natural and expensive rather than merely pretty.</p><p>The stone carries the sort of authority that makes lesser nobles buy it and greater nobles pretend not to care.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 500 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Emerald</strong></p><p>A rich green emerald with small internal threads that prove it is natural and expensive rather than merely pretty. The stone carries the sort of authority that makes lesser nobl...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.5,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":500,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"identifier":"emerald","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"2q1Cvb7GDga4dq13\"><p><em>A cut stone awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This cut stone is described by faceted surfaces and reflected light. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Cut Stone</li><li>Inspection cues: faceted surfaces