{"_id":"3ALOhh6JNInIK4o7","name":"Necklace of Fireballs","type":"consumable","img":"icons/equipment/neck/pendant-faceted-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"3ALOhh6JNInIK4o7\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Necklace of Fireballs</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item</em></p><p>This necklace has 1d6 + 3 beads hanging from it. You can use an action to detach a bead and throw it up to 60 feet away. When it reaches the end of its trajectory, the bead detonates as a 3rd-level @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.ztgcdrWPshKRpFd0]{Fireball} spell (save DC 15).</p><p>You can hurl multiple beads, or even the whole necklace, as one action. When you do so, increase the level of the fireball by 1 for each bead beyond the first.</p><section class=\"secret foundry-note\" id=\"secret-BPYFYGO4aUSbDiBj\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The 9 charges represent the maximum number of beads possible to find; please adjust as required. The Other Formula button can be used to roll the additional damage for extra beads thrown.</p><p>Additionally, here is a price guide depending on the number of beads still remaining. These prices are a guide only and should be adjusted accordingly to reflect the Dungeon Master's world:</p><table><thead><tr><td><strong>Number of Beads</strong></td><td><strong>Price (gp)</strong></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>8</td><td>30,720</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>15,360</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>7680</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>3840</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>1600</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>960</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>480</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>300</td></tr></tbody></table></section></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Jewelry</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 1,600 gp</li><li>9 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Save, Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Necklace of Fireballs</strong></p><p>Wondrous item This necklace has 1d6 + 3 beads hanging from it. You can use an action to detach a bead and throw it up to 60 feet away. When it reaches the end of its trajectory,...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.01,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1600,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"9","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":8,"denomination":6,"bonus":"","types":["fire"],"custom":{"enabled":false,"formula":""},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":null,"formula":""}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"3ALOhh6JNInIK4o7\"><p><em>A jewelry awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This jewelry is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Small details imply more value than a quick glance can confirm.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Jewelry</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"trinket","subtype":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"save","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"condition":"","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Use Necklace of Fireballs; resolve the listed save."},"duration":{"concen