{"_id":"419eNv7xp2p7Xlo5","name":"Blanket","type":"loot","img":"icons/sundries/flags/banner-worn-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"419eNv7xp2p7Xlo5\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Blanket</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A folded wool blanket thick enough to cut wind, soften stone, or keep a watch rotation from turning miserable.</p><p>It is the kind of simple supply every caravan owns in bulk and every survivor learns not to mock.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 5 sp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Blanket</strong></p><p>A folded wool blanket thick enough to cut wind, soften stone, or keep a watch rotation from turning miserable. It is the kind of simple supply every caravan owns in bulk and eve...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"sp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"blanket","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"419eNv7xp2p7Xlo5\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li><