{"_id":"46ikeR4RrSim6DsN","name":"Talisman of the Sphere","type":"consumable","img":"icons/magic/unholy/orb-beam-pink.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"46ikeR4RrSim6DsN\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Talisman of the Sphere</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>When you make an Intelligence (Arcana) check to control a Sphere of Annihilation while you are holding this talisman, you double your proficiency bonus on the check. In addition, when you start your turn with control over a Sphere of Annihilation, you can use an action to levitate it 10 feet plus a number of additional feet equal to 10 × your Intelligence modifier.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Jewelry</li><li>Rarity: Legendary</li><li>Value: 20,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Check</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Talisman of the Sphere</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement) When you make an Intelligence (Arcana) check to control a Sphere of Annihilation while you are holding this talisman, you double your profic...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":20000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"legendary","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":false,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"bonus":"","types":[],"custom":{"enabled":true,"formula":"1d20 + @mod + @attributes.prof + @attributes.prof"},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":