{"_id":"4sR5HOah6KwVPHOb","name":"Wand of Web","type":"consumable","img":"icons/weapons/staves/staff-simple-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"4sR5HOah6KwVPHOb\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Wand of Web</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>(Requires attunement by a spellcaster)</em></p>\n<p>This wand has 7 charges. While holding it, you can use an action to expend 1 of its charges to cast the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.UJJu9c2UvCzVljiP]{Web} spell (save DC 15) from it.</p>\n<p>The wand regains 1d6 + 1 expended charges daily at dawn. If you expend the wand's last charge, roll a d20. On a 1, the wand crumbles into ashes and is destroyed.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Wand</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 2,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>7 use(s), recovers lr</li><li>Activities: Utility, Save, Damage</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Wand of Web</strong></p><p>(Requires attunement by a spellcaster) This wand has 7 charges. While holding it, you can use an action to expend 1 of its charges to cast the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.UJJu9c2Uv...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"7","recovery":[{"period":"lr","type":"formula","formula":"1d6 + 1"}],"autoDestroy":false,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified