{"_id":"69Dpr25pf4BjkHKb","name":"Drum","type":"tool","img":"icons/tools/instruments/drum-brown-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"69Dpr25pf4BjkHKb\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Drum</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A drum, of any variety, to evoke awe, wonder, or fear in your audience.</p>\n<p>If you have proficiency with a given musical instrument, you can add your proficiency bonus to any ability checks you make to play music with the instrument. A bard can use a musical instrument as a spellcasting focus. Each type of musical instrument requires a separate proficiency. </p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Tool, Drum</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 6 gp</li><li>Activities: Check</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Drum</strong></p><p>A drum, of any variety, to evoke awe, wonder, or fear in your audience. If you have proficiency with a given musical instrument, you can add your proficiency bonus to any abilit...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":6,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"ability":"cha","chatFlavor":"","proficient":0,"bonus":"","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"69Dpr25pf4BjkHKb\"><p><em>A drum tool awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This drum tool is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden m