{"folder":"9LJujCqZ6IrLO0Ai","name":"Azurite","type":"loot","_id":"6PaCaukXtK0ueblH","img":"icons/commodities/gems/gem-oval-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"6PaCaukXtK0ueblH\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Azurite</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A deep blue azurite stone polished enough to bring out its dark midnight swirls.</p><p>Though softer than some gems, it is loved by carvers and collectors who want color bold enough to read across a room.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 50 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Azurite</strong></p><p>A deep blue azurite stone polished enough to bring out its dark midnight swirls. Though softer than some gems, it is loved by carvers and collectors who want color bold enough t...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.01,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":50,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"identifier":"azurite","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"6PaCaukXtK0ueblH\"><p><em>A cut stone awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This cut stone is described by faceted surfaces and reflected light. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Cut Stone</li><li>Inspection cues: faceted surfaces and reflected light</li><li>I