PG\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Powdered Silver</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'Segoe UI Variable Text', ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, system-ui, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, 'Apple Color Emoji', Arial, sans-serif, 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'\"><em>Powdered silver is a finely ground, shimmering dust made from pure silver. Each grain sparkles faintly even in dim light, catching and reflecting ambient illumination like tiny stars. The powder has a slightly coarse texture when pinched between the fingers and leaves a faint metallic scent. It is stored in small, airtight pouches or glass vials to preserve its purity and prevent contamination by moisture or other elements.</em></span></p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable</li><li>Value: 10 gp</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Powdered Silver</strong></p><p>Powdered silver is a finely ground, shimmering dust made from pure silver. Each grain sparkles faintly even in dim light, catching and reflecting ambient illumination like tiny...</p>"},"identifier":"new-item","source":{"revision":1,"rules":"2024"},"identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"6kbexHjBmnE0HAPG\"><p><em>An item awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This item is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Item</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified