{"_id":"7i4s9msZWpAw4Ynv","name":"Dagger of Venom","type":"weapon","img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-dagger-poison-dripping-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"7i4s9msZWpAw4Ynv\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Dagger of Venom</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic weapon.</p>\n<p>You can use an action to cause thick, black poison to coat the blade. The poison remains for 1 minute or until an attack using this weapon hits a creature. That creature must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or take 2d10 poison damage and become poisoned for 1 minute. The dagger can't be used this way again until the next dawn.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Weapon, Dagger</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 2,500 gp</li><li>1 use(s), recovers day</li><li>Activities: Attack, Save, Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 applied</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Dagger of Venom</strong></p><p>You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. You can use an action to cause thick, black poison to coat the blade. The poison remains for 1 minute...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2500,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"range":{"value":20,"long":60,"units":"ft","reach":null},"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[{"period":"day","type":"recoverAll"}],"spent":0},"damage":{"versatile":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"bo