{"folder":"9LJujCqZ6IrLO0Ai","name":"Tourmaline","type":"loot","_id":"85mRD0d5phAfu2XN","img":"icons/commodities/gems/gem-rough-cushion-purple-pink.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"85mRD0d5phAfu2XN\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Tourmaline</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A mauve tourmaline crystal with smoky inclusions that seem to drift like storm clouds inside the stone.</p><p>Collectors prize it less for tradition than for how unusual it looks in candlelight and silver settings.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 200 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Tourmaline</strong></p><p>A mauve tourmaline crystal with smoky inclusions that seem to drift like storm clouds inside the stone. Collectors prize it less for tradition than for how unusual it looks in cand...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":200,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"identifier":"tourmaline","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"85mRD0d5phAfu2XN\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by faceted surfaces and reflected light. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: f