{"_id":"8ABk0XV76Hzq8Qul","name":"Amulet of the Planes","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/neck/pendant-faceted-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"8ABk0XV76Hzq8Qul\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Amulet of the Planes</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><div><em>Wondrous Item (requires attunement)</em></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>While wearing this Amulet, you can use an action to name a location that you are familiar with on another plane of existence. Then make a DC 15 Intelligence check. On a successful check, you cast the <em>@Compendium[dnd5e.spells.J6Jpw5XzB5aTeqnz]{Plane Shift}</em> spell. On a failure, you and each creature and object within 15 feet of you travel to a random destination. Roll a d100. On a 1-60, you travel to a random location on the plane you named. On a 61-100, you travel to a randomly determined plane of existence.</div></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Wondrous Item</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 25,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Amulet of the Planes</strong></p><p>Wondrous Item (requires attunement) While wearing this Amulet, you can use an action to name a location that you are familiar with on another plane of existence. Then make a DC...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":25000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"veryRare","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","spent":0,"recovery":[]},"armor":{"value":0,"dex":0,"mag