{"_id":"8RXjiddJ6VGyE7vB","name":"Common Clothes","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/chest/shirt-collared-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"8RXjiddJ6VGyE7vB\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Common Clothes</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A plain set of everyday clothes cut for comfort, repairability, and the kind of work that would ruin finer fabric in a week.</p><p>They are humble by design, but clean common clothes still say something important in most towns: the wearer intends to pass without comment.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 5 sp</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Common Clothes</strong></p><p>A plain set of everyday clothes cut for comfort, repairability, and the kind of work that would ruin finer fabric in a week. They are humble by design, but clean common clothes...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"sp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":null,"dex":null,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"8RXjiddJ6V