{"_id":"8dfhaa1g3VDjhtm3","name":"Eyes of Charming","type":"equipment","img":"icons/creatures/eyes/human-single-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"8dfhaa1g3VDjhtm3\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Eyes of Charming</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>These crystal lenses fit over the eyes. They have 3 charges. While wearing them, you can expend 1 charge as an action to cast the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.eS7XnnApoxRxYXPs]{Charm Person} spell (save DC 13) on a humanoid within 30 feet of you, provided that you and the target can see each other. The lenses regain all expended charges daily at dawn.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 2,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>3 use(s), recovers day</li><li>Activities: Save</li><li>Automated effects: 1 applied</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Eyes of Charming</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement) These crystal lenses fit over the eyes. They have 3 charges. While wearing them, you can expend 1 charge as an action to cast the @Compendiu...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.01,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"3","recovery":[{"period":"day","type":"recoverAll"}],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":0,"dex":0,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"co