{"_id":"8tvhh5wqG5FRh3Sf","name":"Caltrops","type":"consumable","img":"icons/weapons/thrown/bomb-spiked-purple.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"8tvhh5wqG5FRh3Sf\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Caltrops</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>As an action, you can spread a single bag of caltrops to cover a 5-foot-square area. Any creature that enters the area must succeed on a DC 15 Dexterity saving throw or stop moving and take 1 piercing damage. Until the creature regains at least 1 hit point, its walking speed is reduced by 10 feet. A creature moving through the area at half speed doesn't need to make the saving throw.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Trinket</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 5 cp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Save</li><li>Automated effects: 1 applied</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Caltrops</strong></p><p>As an action, you can spread a single bag of caltrops to cover a 5-foot-square area. Any creature that enters the area must succeed on a DC 15 Dexterity saving throw or stop mov...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"cp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"bonus":"","types":["piercing"],"custom":{"enabled":true,"formula":"1"},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":null,"formula":""}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-descrip