{"_id":"9G9QGSPgpZDSsm37","name":"Sledgehammer","type":"loot","img":"icons/tools/smithing/hammer-sledge-steel-grey.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"9G9QGSPgpZDSsm37\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Sledgehammer</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A long-handled sledgehammer with a heavy steel head made for demolition, stakes, and arguments with stone.</p><p>It is slow, exhausting, and exactly the right answer whenever finesse has already failed.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 2 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Sledgehammer</strong></p><p>A long-handled sledgehammer with a heavy steel head made for demolition, stakes, and arguments with stone. It is slow, exhausting, and exactly the right answer whenever finesse...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":10,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"sledgehammer","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"9G9QGSPgpZDSsm37\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by worked metal, balance, and edge finish. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: worked metal, balance, and edge finish</li><li>Identification state: Unidentifie