{"_id":"9bWTRRDym06PzSAf","name":"Pouch","type":"container","img":"icons/containers/bags/coinpouch-simple-tan.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"9bWTRRDym06PzSAf\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Pouch</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A cloth or leather pouch can hold up to 20 sling bullets or 50 blowgun needles, among other things. A compartmentalized pouch for holding spell components is called a component pouch. A pouch can hold up to 1/5 cubic foot or 6 pounds of gear.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Container, Pouch</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 5 sp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Pouch</strong></p><p>A cloth or leather pouch can hold up to 20 sling bullets or 50 blowgun needles, among other things. A compartmentalized pouch for holding spell components is called a component...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"sp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"capacity":{"weight":{"value":6,"units":"lb"},"count":null,"volume":{"value":null,"units":"cubicFoot"}},"currency":{"cp":0,"sp":0,"ep":0,"gp":0,"pp":0},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"9bWTRRDym06PzSAf\"><p><em>A pouch container awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This pouch container is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use i