{"_id":"ADH0UZ8bf7Op0dgf","name":"Crystal Ball of True Seeing","type":"consumable","img":"icons/commodities/gems/pearl-fire.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"ADH0UZ8bf7Op0dgf\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Crystal Ball of True Seeing</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>The Crystal Ball is about 6 inches in diameter. While touching it, you can cast the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.fVbCxFRaORalHB20]{Scrying} spell (save DC 17) with it.</p>\n<p>While Scrying with the Crystal Ball, you have Truesight with a radius of 120 feet centered on the spell's sensor.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Trinket</li><li>Rarity: Legendary</li><li>Value: 60,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Crystal Ball of True Seeing</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement) The Crystal Ball is about 6 inches in diameter. While touching it, you can cast the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.fVbCxFRaORalHB20]{Scrying} spel...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":7,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":60000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"legendary","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":false,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"