{"_id":"BjyTJn9oGvURWKJR","name":"Manual of Bodily Health","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/books/book-backed-silver-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"BjyTJn9oGvURWKJR\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Manual of Bodily Health</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item</em></p>\n<p>This book contains health and diet tips, and its words are charged with magic. If you spend 48 hours over a period of 6 days or fewer studying the book's contents and practicing its guidelines, your Constitution score increases by 2, as does your maximum for that score. The manual then loses its magic, but regains it in a century.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Book</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 100,000 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 applied</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Manual of Bodily Health</strong></p><p>Wondrous item This book contains health and diet tips, and its words are charged with magic. If you spend 48 hours over a period of 6 days or fewer studying the book&#39;s contents...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":100000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"veryRare","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-ite