{"_id":"DEQkJiQdGyfmSNkV","name":"Helm of Teleportation","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/head/helm-barbute-horned-copper.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"DEQkJiQdGyfmSNkV\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Helm of Teleportation</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>This helm has 3 charges. While wearing it, you can use an action and expend 1 charge to cast the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.L4J89JXqbKs6puEV]{Teleport} spell from it. The helm regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Wondrous Item</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 20,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>3 use(s), recovers lr</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Helm of Teleportation</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement) This helm has 3 charges. While wearing it, you can use an action and expend 1 charge to cast the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.L4J89JXqbKs6puEV]{...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":2,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":20000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"3","recovery":[{"period":"lr","type":"formula","formula":"1d3"}],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":0,"dex":null,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-