{"_id":"Do3qeSHtBjUsmfvz","name":"Rod of Alertness","type":"consumable","img":"icons/magic/defensive/illusion-evasion-echo-purple.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"Do3qeSHtBjUsmfvz\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Rod of Alertness</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>(Requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>This rod has a flanged head and the following properties.</p>\n<p><strong>Alertness</strong>. While holding the rod, you have advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks and on rolls for initiative.</p>\n<p><strong>Spells</strong>. While holding the rod, you can use an action to cast one of the following spells from it: @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.Mzh95utKDPIrjiH8]{Detect Evil and Good}, @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.ghXTfe7sgCbgf1Q8]{Detect Magic}, @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.2skfDtglk1mGrb3l]{Detect Poison and Disease}, or @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.DQzlB5Y3k791W5bH]{See Invisibility}.</p>\n<p><strong>Protective Aura</strong>. As an action, you can plant the haft end of the rod in the ground, whereupon the rod's head sheds bright light in a 60-foot radius and dim light for an additional 60 feet. While in that bright light, you and any creature that is friendly to you gain a +1 bonus to AC and saving throws and can sense the location of any invisible hostile creature that is also in the bright light.</p>\n<p>The rod's head stops glowing and the effect ends after 10 minutes, or when a creature uses an action to pull the rod from the ground.. This property can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Rod</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 25,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>1 use(s), recovers day</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 passive</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Rod of Alertness</strong></p><p>(Requires attunement) This rod has a flanged head and the following properties. Alertness . While holding the rod, you have advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks and on rolls...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":5,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":25000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"veryRare","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[{"period":"day","type":"recoverAll"}],"autoDestroy":false,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"Do3qeSHtBjUsmfvz\"><p><em>A provision awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This provision is described by freshness, aroma, and preparation. It carries the kind of presence that makes casual appraisal feel inadequate.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Provision</li><li>Inspection cues: freshness, aroma, and preparation</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"rod","subtype":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"utility","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"condition":"Rod must be planted in the ground.","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Use Rod of Alertness."},"duration":{"concentration":false,"value":"10","units":"minute","special":"",