{"_id":"ElLfmohtIFMagr5f","name":"Ring of Animal Influence","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/finger/ring-cabochon-gold-orange.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"ElLfmohtIFMagr5f\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Ring of Animal Influence</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>This ring has 3 charges, and it regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. While wearing the ring, you can use an action to expend 1 of its charges to cast one of the following spells:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>@Compendium[dnd5e.spells.hDOENzjuj5WpLq7B]{Animal Friendship} (save DC 13)</li>\n<li>@Compendium[dnd5e.spells.XXUDGFELgoskdOD0]{Fear} (save DC 13), targeting only beasts that have an Intelligence of 3 or lower</li>\n<li>@Compendium[dnd5e.spells.aL1F8fvYLtNzUbKu]{Speak with Animals}</li>\n</ul></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment, Ring</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 4,000 gp</li><li>3 use(s), recovers lr</li><li>Activities: Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Ring of Animal Influence</strong></p><p>This ring has 3 charges, and it regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. While wearing the ring, you can use an action to expend 1 of its charges to cast one of the following...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":4000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"3","recovery":[{"period":"lr","type":"formula","formula":"1d3"}],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":0,"dex":0,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max"