{"_id":"FkDyLSpiynKTQZdi","name":"Wings of Flying","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/back/cloak-heavy-fur-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"FkDyLSpiynKTQZdi\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Wings of Flying</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>While wearing this cloak, you can use an action to speak its command word. This turns the cloak into a pair of bat wings or bird wings on your back for 1 hour or until you repeat the command word as an action. The wings give you a flying speed of 60 feet. When they disappear, you can't use them again for 1d12 hours.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 5,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 applied</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Wings of Flying</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement) While wearing this cloak, you can use an action to speak its command word. This turns the cloak into a pair of bat wings or bird wings on yo...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":null,"dex":null,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"unidentified":{"description":"<section