{"_id":"FvNOwWbh5FXyX4xe","name":"Alchemist's Fire","type":"consumable","img":"icons/consumables/potions/bottle-round-corked-yellow.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"FvNOwWbh5FXyX4xe\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Alchemist&#39;s Fire</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>This sticky, adhesive fluid ignites when exposed to air. As an action, you can throw this flask up to 20 feet, shattering it on impact. Make a ranged attack against a creature or object, treating the alchemist's fire as an improvised weapon. On a hit, the target takes 1d4 fire damage at the start of each of its turns. A creature can end this damage by using its action to make a DC 10 Dexterity check to extinguish the flames.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Potion</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 50 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Attack, Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Alchemist&#39;s Fire</strong></p><p>This sticky, adhesive fluid ignites when exposed to air. As an action, you can throw this flask up to 20 feet, shattering it on impact. Make a ranged attack against a creature o...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":50,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":1,"denomination":4,"bonus":"","types":["fire"],"custom":{"enabled":false,"formula":""},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":null,"formula":""}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"descr