{"_id":"G7LqGzKR5ts0WlJ9","name":"Hourglass","type":"loot","img":"icons/tools/navigation/hourglass-grey.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"G7LqGzKR5ts0WlJ9\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Hourglass</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>It is a device used to measure the passage of time. It comprises two glass bulbs connected vertically by a narrow neck that allows a regulated trickle of sand from the upper bulb to the lower one.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 25 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Hourglass</strong></p><p>It is a device used to measure the passage of time. It comprises two glass bulbs connected vertically by a narrow neck that allows a regulated trickle of sand from the upper bulb...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":25,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"hourglass","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"G7LqGzKR5ts0WlJ9\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by faceted surfaces and reflected light. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: faceted surfaces and reflected light</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"co