{"_id":"GP2bvHlxVi30OEmo","name":"Figurine of Wondrous Power (Marble Elephant)","type":"consumable","img":"icons/commodities/bones/horn-simple-grey.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"GP2bvHlxVi30OEmo\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Figurine of Wondrous Power (Marble Elephant)</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item</em></p>\n<p>A <em>figurine of wondrous power</em> is a statuette of a beast small enough to fit in a pocket. If you use an action to speak the command word and throw the figurine to a point on the ground within 60 feet of you, the figurine becomes a living creature. If the space where the creature would appear is occupied by other creatures or objects, or if there isn't enough space for the creature, the figurine doesn't become a creature.</p>\n<p>The creature is friendly to you and your companions. It understands your languages and obeys your spoken commands. If you issue no commands, the creature defends itself but takes no other actions.</p>\n<p>The creature exists for a duration specific to each figurine. At the end of the duration, the creature reverts to its figurine form. It reverts to a figurine early if it drops to 0 hit points or if you use an action to speak the command word again while touching it. When the creature becomes a figurine again, its property can't be used again until a certain amount of time has passed, as specified in the figurine's description.</p>\n<p><strong>Marble Elephant</strong>. This marble statuette is about 4 inches high and long. It can become an @Compendium[dnd5e.monsters.jLPhaBnMtAbB5dp1]{Elephant} for up to 24 hours. Once it has been used, it can't be used again until 7 days have passed.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Figurine</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 6,000 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Figurine of Wondrous Power (Marble Elephant)</strong></p><p>Wondrous item A figurine of wondrous power is a statuette of a beast small enough to fit in a pocket. If you use an action to speak the command word and throw the figurine to a...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":6000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":false,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"GP2bvHlxVi30OEmo\"><p><em>A small figure awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This small figure is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. The workmanship suggests it deserves careful study before anyone relies on it.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Small Figure</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"trinket","subtype":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"utility","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"condition":"","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Use Figurine of Wondrous Power (Marble Elephant)."},"duration":{"concentration":false,"value":"24","units":"hour","special":"","override":false},"effects":[],"range":{"value":"60","units":"ft","special":"","override":false},"target":{"template":{"count":"","contiguous":false,"type":"","size":"","width":"","height":"","units":"ft"},"affects":{"count":"15","type":"space","choice":false,"special":""},"prompt":true,"override":false},"uses":{"spent":0,"max":"","recovery":[]},"roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":false},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionText":"","macroData":{"name":"","command":""},"ignoreTraits":{"idi":false,"idr":false,"idv":false,"ida":false},"midiProperties":{"ignoreTraits":[],"triggeredActivityId":"none","triggeredActivityConditionText":"","triggeredActivityTargets":"targets","triggeredActivityRollAs":"self","forceDialog":false,"confirmTargets":"default","autoTargetType":"any","autoTargetAction":"default","automationOnly":false,"otherActivityCompatible":true,"identifier":"","displayActivityName":false,"rollMode":"default","chooseEffects":false,"toggleEffect":false,"ignoreFullCover":false},"isOverTimeFlag":false,"overTimeProperties":{"saveRemoves":true,"preRemoveConditionText":"","postRemoveConditionText":""},"otherActivityId":"none"}},"identifier":"figurine-of-wondrous-power-marble-elephant","container":null,"attuned":false,"magicalBonus":null,"properties":[]},"effects":[],"folder":"R03VUV62XKsfqf02","flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.dnd5e.items.Item.GP2bvHlxVi30OEmo"},"dnd5e":{"riders":{"activity":[],"effect":[]}},"midi-qol":{"rollAttackPerTarget":"default","removeAttackDamageButtons":"default","effectActivation":false,"itemCondition":"","reactionCondition":"","otherCondition":"","effectCondition":""},"dae":{"disableIncapacitated":false,"selfTarget":true,"selfTargetAlways":true,"dontApply":false,"stackable":"noneName","showIcon":true,"durationExpression":"","macroRepeat":"none","specialDuration":[]},"midiProperties":{"confirmTargets":"default","autoFailFriendly":false,"autoSaveFriendly":false,"critOther":false,"offHandWeapon":false,"magicdam":false,"magiceffect":false,"concentration":false,"noConcentrationCheck":false,"toggleEffect":false,"ignoreTotalCover":false},"infinity-dnd5e":{"keywords":["activation.action","automation.activity","automation.activity.utility","automation.mode.usable","curation.medium","economy.sellable","folder.family.consumables","folder.path.consumables.arcane-consumables","folder.section.arcane-consumables","foundryType.consumable","loot","loot.consumable","magic.bonus","merchant.consumable","merchant.magic","price.gp","rarity.rare","sale.specialty","sale.standard","source.class.generated","source.dnd5e.items","source.policy.normal","subtype.trinket","target.space","tier.t3","value.high","value.v5","weight.light"],"lootType":"loot.consumable","tier":"tier.t3","rarityNormalized":"rare","gpValue":6000,"valueBand":"value.v5","taggedAt":"2026-04-20T00:02:30.081Z","tagSchema":"po-loot-v3","details":{"schema":"po-item-enrichment-v3","itemType":"consumable","activityCount":1,"effectCount":0,"hasDescription":true,"coreSourceId":"Compendium.dnd5e.items.Item.GP2bvHlxVi30OEmo","folderPathKey":"consumables/arcane-consumables","folderLabels":["Consumables","Arcane Consumables"],"primaryMode":"usable","activityTypes":["utility"],"activationTypes":["action"],"transferEffectCount":0,"appliedEffectCount":0},"pricingSource":"system","priceDenomination":"gp","merchantCategories":["consumable","magic"],"saleLiquidity":"sale.standard","lootWeight":0.24,"maxRecommendedQty":1,"lootEligible":true,"sellValueGp":3000,"folder":{"schema":"po-loot-folder-v1","familyKey":"consumables","familyLabel":"Consumables","sectionKey":"arcane-consumables","sectionLabel":"Arcane Consumables","leafKey":"","leafLabel":"","path":[{"key":"consumables","label":"Consumables","sort":3000},{"key":"arcane-consumables","label":"Arcane Consumables","sort":3500}],"pathLabels":["Consumables","Arcane Consumables"],"pathKeys":["consumables","arcane-consumables"],"pathKey":"consumables/arcane-consumables"},"usability":{"schema":"po-loot-usage-v1","isUsable":true,"primaryMode":"usable","activityCount":1,"activityTypes":["utility"],"primaryActivityType":"utility","activationTypes":["action"],"targetTypes":["space"],"effectCount":0,"transferEffectCount":0,"appliedEffectCount":0,"hasPassiveEffects":false,"hasAppliedEffects":false,"integrations":[]},"sourceClass":"generated","sourcePolicy":"normal","curationScore":7,"art":{"schema":"infinity-dnd5e-art-assignment-v1","mode":"reusable","assetId":"shared/consumable-consumables-arcane-consumables","plannedPath":"assets/item-art/shared/consumable-consumables-arcane-consumables.webp","fallbackIcon":"icons/commodities/bones/horn-simple-grey.webp","generated":false},"descriptionState":{"schema":"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1","identified":true,"unidentified":true}}},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.dnd5e.items.Item.GP2bvHlxVi30OEmo","duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"12.343","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.4.4","createdTime":1771268199232,"modifiedTime":1771268199232,"lastModifiedBy":"GFVfiCPdpln7qZBb"},"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"GFVfiCPdpln7qZBb":3}}
{"name":"Inconspicuous Box","type":"container","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"GUgSvlEeG7ownaX0\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Inconspicuous Box</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><h1>Overview</h1><p>The Inconspicuous Box is a rare magical artifact designed to shield its contents from all forms of scrying magic. Crafted by arcane masters, this box is a must-have for adventurers and secretive individuals who need to protect their most valuable possessions from prying magical eyes.</p><h2>Appearance and Craftsmanship</h2><p>At first glance, the Inconspicuous Box appears to be a simple, elegant wooden case, often adorned with intricate runes and symbols associated with privacy and protection. Its exterior is reinforced with iron bands, making it not only magically secure but also physically sturdy. The interior is lined with velvet, cradling its contents gently.</p><h2>Magical Properties</h2><p>The primary magic of the Inconspicuous Box lies in its ability to completely negate any scrying attempts. Whether the scrying spell is cast directly at the coffer or its vicinity, the magic within the coffer creates a null zone, rendering such attempts ineffective. This feature is always active and requires no activation from the user.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-CDMErwUxx8PGMzIq\"><h2>Secret Mechanisms</h2><p>Unknown to many, the Inconspicuous Box also has a hidden compartment, accessible only by manipulating a sequence of runes in a specific order. This compartment provides an extra layer of security for exceptionally valuable items.</p></section><h2>Usage and Limitations</h2><p>While the Inconspicuous Box is exceptionally effective at countering scrying magic, it does have its limitations. It does not protect against physical theft, and its magic is ineffective against divine intervention or curses. The coffer is also limited in size, typically able to hold items no larger than a small chest.</p><h2>History and Origin</h2><p>The origin of the Inconspicuous Box is shrouded in mystery. Legend suggests it was first created by a cabal of wizards who sought to protect their arcane research from rival mages. Over time, its existence became known to thieves' guilds and collectors, making it a highly sought-after item for those in need of secure storage for their secrets.</p><h2>Acquisition</h2><p>Obtaining an Inconspicuous Box is no easy feat. They are rarely found in common markets and are often sold through secretive auctions or as rewards for formidable quests. The cost of an Inconspicuous Box can be exorbitant, reflecting its rarity and powerful protective abilities.</p><h2>Game Mechanics</h2><p>When an item is placed within the Inconspicuous Box, any scrying spell targeting the item or attempting to perceive the item's location automatically fails. This includes spells like <em>Scrying</em>, <em>Locate Object</em>, and <em>Clairvoyance</em>. The hidden compartment, if found, can hold an item of no more than 1 pound in weight.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Container, Inconspicuous Box</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 5,000 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>inconspicuous Box</strong></p><p>Overview The Inconspicuous Box is a rare magical artifact designed to shield its contents from all forms of scrying magic. Crafted by arcane masters, this box is a must-have...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":2,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"capacity":{"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"count":null,"volume":{"value":null,"units":"cubicFoot"}},"currency":{"cp":0,"sp":0,"ep":0,"gp":0,"pp":0},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"GUgSvlEeG7ownaX0\"><p><em>An inconspicuous box container awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This inconspicuous box container is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. The workmanship suggests it deserves careful study before anyone relies on it.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Inconspicuous Box Container</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"container":null,"properties":["weightlessContents"],"identifier":"inconspicuous-box","attuned":false,"activities":{}},"_id":"GUgSvlEeG7ownaX0","img":"icons/containers/chest/chest-simple-box-brown.webp","effects":[],"folder":"R03VUV62XKsfqf02","flags":{"itemcollection":{"bagWeight":1,"bagPrice":null,"weightlessUnequipped":false,"contentsData":[{"_id":"2tdzbhepchMnYA0L","name":"Amulet of solara","type":"loot","img":"icons/equipment/neck/pendant-bronze-gem-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p></p><p>@UUID[JournalEntry.LZfQ4K7K9DEseoJx]{The Amulet Of Solara}</p><h2>Properties</h2><ul><li>Artifact Sensing: The wearer can sense the presence of lost artifacts within a 5-mile radius. The sensing ability grows more powerful as the wearer learns more about the Relic.</li><li>Vision of the Lost: Once per day, the amulet can be activated to reveal a vision of the location of a specific lost artifact, as long as the wearer knows its name or has some knowledge of its appearance or history. The vision shows a brief glimpse of the artifact's current location, but may be accompanied by a sense of danger or warning if the artifact is in the possession of evil forces or guarded by dangerous creatures.</li><li>Protection Against the Dark: The amulet provides resistance against fire and necrotic damage and allows the wearer to see through magical darkness, offering protection against demonic or fiendish powers.</li></ul>","chat":"","unidentified":"Gear"},"source":"Basic Rules, Player's Handbook","quantity":1,"weight":1,"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":250000,"ownership":{"default":0,"GFVfiCPdpln7qZBb":3,"Q666jcKfvgLl12rs":3},"flags":{"ddbimporter":{"dndbeyond":{"type":"Holy Symbol","isConsumable":false,"isContainer":false,"isCustomItem":false,"isHomebrew":false,"isMonkWeapon":false,"isPack":false,"levelInfusionGranted":null,"tags":["Utility"],"sources":[{"sourceId":1,"pageNumber":null,"sourceType":2},{"sourceId":2,"pageNumber":null,"sourceType":1}],"stackable":true},"id":932289514,"entityTypeId":1439493548,"containerEntityId":84336786,"containerEntityTypeId":1581111423,"definitionEntityTypeId":2103445194,"definitionId":159,"originalName":"Amulet","version":"3.4.57","importId":"TlQw0myDJCni7oVV"},"infusions":{"maps":[],"applied":[],"infused":false},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.infinity-dnd5e.infinity-dnd5e-items.Item.GUgSvlEeG7ownaX0"},"midi-qol":{"onUseMacroParts":{"items":[]}}},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.3.1","coreVersion":"11.315","createdTime":1692558023814,"modifiedTime":1699769650330,"lastModifiedBy":"GFVfiCPdpln7qZBb"}}]},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.infinity-dnd5e.infinity-dnd5e-items.Item.GUgSvlEeG7ownaX0"},"dnd5e":{},"midi-qol":{"rollAttackPerTarget":"default","removeAttackDamageButtons":"default","effectActivation":false,"itemCondition":"","reactionCondition":"","otherCondition":"","effectCondition":""},"dae":{"disableIncapacitated":false,"selfTarget":true,"selfTargetAlways":true,"dontApply":false,"stackable":"noneName","showIcon":true,"durationExpression":"","macroRepeat":"none","specialDuration":[]},"midiProperties":{"confi