{"_id":"HZp69hhyNZUUCipF","name":"Glass Bottle","type":"container","img":"icons/consumables/potions/bottle-bulb-empty-glass.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"HZp69hhyNZUUCipF\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Glass Bottle</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A stoppered glass bottle suited to cordials, lamp oil, tinctures, or any liquid that deserves to be seen before it is poured.</p><p>Glass makes contents easier to judge and transport slightly riskier, which is why careful merchants wrap bottles before they haggle over them.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Container, Glass Bottle</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 2 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Glass Bottle</strong></p><p>A stoppered glass bottle suited to cordials, lamp oil, tinctures, or any liquid that deserves to be seen before it is poured. Glass makes contents easier to judge and transport...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":2,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"capacity":{"weight":{"value":6,"units":"lb"},"count":null,"volume":{"value":null,"units":"cubicFoot"}},"currency":{"cp":0,"sp":0,"ep":0,"gp":0,"pp":0},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"HZp69hhyNZUUCipF\"><p><em>A glass bottle container awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This glass bottle containe