{"_id":"HZsvDPmvysQKGzGy","name":"Steel Mirror","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/currency/coin-engraved-slot-one-copper.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"HZsvDPmvysQKGzGy\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Steel Mirror</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A polished steel mirror set in a simple backing, bright enough to catch a face, a signal flash, or bad news behind you.</p><p>Unlike glass, it travels hard and survives packs, saddlebags, and suspicious adventurers.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 5 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Steel Mirror</strong></p><p>A polished steel mirror set in a simple backing, bright enough to catch a face, a signal flash, or bad news behind you. Unlike glass, it travels hard and survives packs, saddleb...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.5,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"steel-mirror","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"HZsvDPmvysQKGzGy\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li