{"_id":"HokQ1loVJTFxt27u","name":"Vorpal Longsword","type":"weapon","img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-sword-steel-yellow.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"HokQ1loVJTFxt27u\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Vorpal Longsword</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>(Requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>You gain a +3 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. In addition, the weapon ignores resistance to slashing damage.</p>\n<p>When you attack a creature that has at least one head with this weapon and roll a 20 on the attack roll, you cut off one of the creature's heads. The creature dies if it can't survive without the lost head. A creature is immune to this effect if it is immune to slashing damage, doesn't have or need a head, has legendary actions, or the GM decides that the creature is too big for its head to be cut off with this weapon. Such a creature instead takes an extra 6d8 slashing damage from the hit.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Weapon, Longsword</li><li>Rarity: Legendary</li><li>Value: 25,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Attack, Damage</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Vorpal Longsword</strong></p><p>(Requires attunement) You gain a +3 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. In addition, the weapon ignores resistance to slashing damage. When you attack...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":25000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"legendary","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"ft","reach":null},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"damage":{"versatile":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"bonus":"","types":[],"custom":{"enabled":true,"formula":"1d10 + @mod + 3"},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":null,"formula":""}},"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"bonus":"","types":["slashing"],"custom":{"enabled":true,"formula":"1d8 + @mod + 3"},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":null,"formula":""}}},"armor":{"value":10},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"properties":["ver","mgc"],"proficient":1,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"HokQ1loVJTFxt27u\"><p><em>A longsword weapon awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This longsword weapon is described by worked metal, balance, and edge finish. It carries the kind of presence that makes casual appraisal feel inadequate.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Longsword Weapon</li><li>Inspection cues: worked metal, balance, and edge finish</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"martialM","baseItem":"longsword"},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"attack","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"condition":"","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Attack with Vorpal Longsword."},"duration":{"concentration":false,"value":"","units":"inst","special":"","override":false},"effects":[],"range":{"units":"ft","special":"","override":false},"target":{"template":{"count":"","contiguous":false,"type":"","size":"","width":"","height":"","units":""},"affects":{"count":"","type":"","choice":false,"special":""},"prompt":true,"override":false},"uses":{"spent":0,"max":""