{"name":"Canvas","type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"IcBuh7RHzFltgk8M\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Canvas</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A square yard of canvas of average quality and weight. Used for all manner of items and clothing.</p>\n<p>Graded from 1 to 12, the lower the number, the better the quality and the heavier the weight. #1 quality canvas weighs around 1.7 pounds per square yard, while the weaker, lighter #12 can weigh only 0.7 pounds.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 1 sp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Canvas</strong></p><p>A square yard of canvas of average quality and weight. Used for all manner of items and clothing. Graded from 1 to 12, the lower the number, the better the quality and the heavier...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1.2,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1,"denomination":"sp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"canvas","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"IcBuh7RHzFltgk8M\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by stitching, wear, and fitted seams. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: stitching, wear, and fitted seams</li><li>Identification state: Unidentifie