{"folder":"KaKDVFvn1yVZzCXi","name":"Deer Hide","type":"loot","_id":"KTvBW6HNAMAoqEN7","img":"icons/equipment/shoulder/shoulderpad-fur-leather.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"KTvBW6HNAMAoqEN7\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Deer Hide</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A cleaned deer hide trimmed for trade, thick enough for leatherworking but still showing the natural grain and color of the original coat.</p><p>Tanners, trappers, and rural outfitters buy bundles like this for winter capes, patching work, and hard-wearing travel gear.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 2 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Deer Hide</strong></p><p>A cleaned deer hide trimmed for trade, thick enough for leatherworking but still showing the natural grain and color of the original coat. Tanners, trappers, and rural outfitter...</p>"},"identifier":"new-item","source":{"revision":1,"rules":"2024"},"identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"KTvBW6HNAMAoqEN7\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by stitching, wear, and fitted seams. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: stitching, wear, and fitted seams</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},