{"_id":"LBajgahniRJbAgDr","name":"Spellbook","type":"loot","img":"icons/sundries/books/book-embossed-jewel-gold-purple.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"LBajgahniRJbAgDr\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spellbook</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A leather-bound spellbook filled with blank vellum and the expectation that expensive knowledge will eventually live there.</p><p>Even empty, it is a specialist&#39;s tool: part notebook, part laboratory ledger, and part invitation to sink gold into ink forever.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 50 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spellbook</strong></p><p>A leather-bound spellbook filled with blank vellum and the expectation that expensive knowledge will eventually live there. Even empty, it is a specialist&#39;s tool: part notebook,...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":50,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"spellbook","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"LBajgahniRJbAgDr\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by paper stock, ink, and binding. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: paper stock, ink, and bindin