{"name":"Iron","type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"M2jQ9hMZdqKdrmpj\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Iron</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>Often the workhorse of the metalworker, iron is appreciated for its relative abundance and ease of attainment. Surface iron can be found from fallen meteors and xenoliths, but is much more commonly mined underground. However, care must be given otherwise rust will take its toll.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 1 sp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Iron</strong></p><p>Often the workhorse of the metalworker, iron is appreciated for its relative abundance and ease of attainment. Surface iron can be found from fallen meteors and xenoliths, but i...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1,"denomination":"sp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"iron","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"M2jQ9hMZdqKdrmpj\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"contai