{"_id":"M5APnDW8bKQb7fHI","name":"Shield of Missile Attraction","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/shield/oval-wooden-boss-steel.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"M5APnDW8bKQb7fHI\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Shield of Missile Attraction</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>(Requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>While holding this shield, you have resistance to damage from ranged weapon attacks.</p>\n<p><strong>Curse</strong>. This shield is cursed. Attuning to it curses you until you are targeted by the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.XZhdgVK3cLoxNCQl]{Remove Curse} spell or similar magic. Removing the shield fails to end the curse on you. Whenever a ranged weapon attack is made against a target within 10 feet of you, the curse causes you to become the target instead.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 6,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Shield of Missile Attraction</strong></p><p>(Requires attunement) While holding this shield, you have resistance to damage from ranged weapon attacks. Curse . This shield is cursed. Attuning to it curses you until you are...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":6,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":6000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":2,"dex":null,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"M5APnDW8bKQb7fHI\"><p><em>An armor awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This armor is described by worked metal, balance, and edge finish. The workmanship suggests it deserves careful study before anyone relies on it.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Armor</li><li>Inspection cues: worked metal, balance, and edge finish</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"shield","baseItem":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"utility","activation":{"type":"special","value":1,"condition":"Any ranged attack within 10 ft. of you causes you to be the target.","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Use Shield of Missile Attraction."},"duration":{"concentration":false,"value":"","units":"inst","special":"","override":false},"effects":[],"range":{"value":"10","units":"ft","special":"","override":false},"target":{"template":{"count":"","contiguous":false,"type":"","size":"","width":"","height":"","units":""},"affects":{"count":"","type":"self","choice":false,"special":""},"prompt":true,"override":false},"uses":{"spent":0,"max":"","recovery":[]},"roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":false},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionText":"","macroData":{"name":"","command":""},"ignoreTraits":{"idi":false,"idr":false,"idv":false,"ida":false},"midiProperties":{"ignoreTraits":[],"triggeredActivityId":"none","triggeredActivityConditionText":"","triggeredActivityTargets":"targets","triggeredActivityRollAs":"self","forceDialog":false,"confirmTargets":"default","autoT