{"_id":"M8xM8BLK4tpUayEE","name":"Iron Pot","type":"container","img":"icons/tools/laboratory/cauldron-filled-gold.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"M8xM8BLK4tpUayEE\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Iron Pot</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A black iron pot broad enough for stew, boiling water, dye, or any work that asks more of heat than of elegance.</p><p>Camp cooks and labor crews trust gear like this because it survives soot, rough handling, and recipes that start with whatever is left.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Container, Iron Pot</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 2 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Iron Pot</strong></p><p>A black iron pot broad enough for stew, boiling water, dye, or any work that asks more of heat than of elegance. Camp cooks and labor crews trust gear like this because it survi...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":10,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"capacity":{"weight":{"value":8.4,"units":"lb"},"count":null,"volume":{"value":null,"units":"cubicFoot"}},"currency":{"cp":0,"sp":0,"ep":0,"gp":0,"pp":0},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"M8xM8BLK4tpUayEE\"><p><em>An iron pot container awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This iron pot container is described by craftsmanship, condition, a