{"_id":"NG8BlE2nwYJxCjWO","name":"Animated Shield","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/shield/heater-steel-sword-yellow-black.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"NG8BlE2nwYJxCjWO\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Animated Shield</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>(Requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>While holding this shield, you can speak its command word as a bonus action to cause it to animate. The shield leaps into the air and hovers in your space to protect you as if you were wielding it, leaving your hands free. The shield remains animated for 1 minute, until you use a bonus action to end this effect, or until you are incapacitated or die, at which point the shield falls to the ground or into your hand if you have one free.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 6,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Animated Shield</strong></p><p>(Requires attunement) While holding this shield, you can speak its command word as a bonus action to cause it to animate. The shield leaps into the air and hovers in your space...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":6,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":6000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"veryRare","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":2,"dex":0,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"str