{"_id":"NtdDkjmpdIMiX7I2","name":"Dulcimer","type":"tool","img":"icons/tools/instruments/lute-gold-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"NtdDkjmpdIMiX7I2\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Dulcimer</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A dulcimer to evoke awe, wonder, or fear in your audience.</p>\n<p>If you have proficiency with a given musical instrument, you can add your proficiency bonus to any ability checks you make to play music with the instrument. A bard can use a musical instrument as a spellcasting focus. Each type of musical instrument requires a separate proficiency. </p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Tool, Dulcimer</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 25 gp</li><li>Activities: Check</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Dulcimer</strong></p><p>A dulcimer to evoke awe, wonder, or fear in your audience. If you have proficiency with a given musical instrument, you can add your proficiency bonus to any ability checks you...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":10,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":25,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"ability":"cha","chatFlavor":"","proficient":0,"bonus":"","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"NtdDkjmpdIMiX7I2\"><p><em>A dulcimer tool awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This dulcimer tool is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Dulcimer Tool</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"music","baseItem":"dulcimer"},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"check","activation":{"type":"special","value":1,"condition":"","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Use Dulcimer for the associated check."},"duration":{"concentration":false,"units":"inst","special":"","override":false,"value":""},"effects":[],"range":{"units":"self","special":"","override":false},"target":{"template":{"count":"","contiguous":false,"type":"","size":"","width":"","height":"","units":"ft"},"affects":{"count":"","type":"","choice":false,"special":""},"prompt":true,"override":false},"uses":{"spent":0,"max":"","recovery":[]},"check":{"ability":"cha","associated":[],"dc":{}},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionText":"","macroData":{"name":"","command":""},"ignoreTraits":{"idi":false,"idr":false,"idv":false,"ida":false},"midiProperties":{"ignoreTraits":[],"triggeredActivityId":"none","triggeredActivityConditionText":"","triggeredActivityTargets":"targets","triggeredActivityRollAs":"self","forceDialog":false,"confirmTargets":"default","autoTargetType":"any","autoTargetAction":"default","automationOnly":false,"otherActivityCompatible":true,"identifier":"","displayActivityName":false,"rollMode":"default","chooseEffects":false,"toggleEffect":false,"ignoreFullCover":false},"isOverTimeFlag":false,"overTimeProperties":{"saveRemoves":true,"preRemoveConditionText":"","postRemoveConditionText":""},"otherActivityId":"none","damage":{"onSave":"half","parts":[]},"roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":fa