{"_id":"PAXfmZ2ErDlCVy0N","name":"Talisman of Ultimate Evil","type":"consumable","img":"icons/magic/death/skull-horned-goat-pentagram-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"PAXfmZ2ErDlCVy0N\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Talisman of Ultimate Evil</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement by a creature of evil alignment)</em></p>\n<p>This item symbolizes unrepentant evil. A creature that is neither good nor evil in alignment takes 6d6 necrotic damage upon touching the talisman. A good creature takes 8d6 necrotic damage upon touching the talisman. Either sort of creature takes the damage again each time it ends its turn holding or carrying the talisman.</p>\n<p>If you are an evil cleric or paladin, you can use the talisman as a holy symbol, and you gain a +2 bonus to spell attack rolls while you wear or hold it.</p>\n<p>The talisman has 6 charges. If you are wearing or holding it, you can use an action to expend 1 charge from the talisman and choose one creature you can see on the ground within 120 feet of you. If the target is of good alignment, a flaming fissure opens under it. The target must succeed on a DC 20 Dexterity saving throw or fall into the fissure and be destroyed, leaving no remains. The fissure then closes, leaving no trace of its existence. When you expend the last charge, the talisman dissolves into foul-smelling slime and is destroyed.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Jewelry</li><li>Rarity: Legendary</li><li>Value: 61,440 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>6 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Save, Damage</li><li>Automated effects: 1 passive</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Talisman of Ultimate Evil</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement by a creature of evil alignment) This item symbolizes unrepentant evil. A creature that is neither good nor evil in alignment takes 6d6 necro...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":61440,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"legendary","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"6","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":6,"denomination":6,"bonus":"","types":["necrotic"],"custom":{"enabled":false,"formula":""},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":null,"formula":""}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"PAXfmZ2ErDlCVy0N\"><p><em>A jewelry awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This jewelry is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. It carries the kind of presence that makes casual appraisal feel inadequate.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Jewelry</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"trinket","subtype":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"save","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"condition":"","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Use Talisman of Ultimate Evil; resolve the listed save."},"duration":{"concentration":false,"value":"","units":"inst","special":"","override":false},"effects":[],"range":{"value":"120","units