{"_id":"RDPFmUR9exTEXFc8","name":"Boots of the Winterlands","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/feet/boots-leather-banded-furred.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"RDPFmUR9exTEXFc8\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Boots of the Winterlands</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>These furred boots are snug and feel quite warm. While you wear them, you gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You have resistance to cold damage.</li>\n<li>You ignore difficult terrain created by ice or snow. You can tolerate temperatures as low as -50 degrees Fahrenheit without any additional protection. If you wear heavy clothes, you can tolerate temperatures as low as -100 degrees Fahrenheit.</li>\n</ul></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 2,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 passive</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Boots of the Winterlands</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement) These furred boots are snug and feel quite warm. While you wear them, you gain the following benefits: You have resistance to cold damage. Y...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","spent":0,"recovery":[]},"armor":{"value":0,"dex":0,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"val