{"name":"Chicken","type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"TM9VmwPoJBHqJzqK\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Chicken</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A live chicken trussed for travel, noisy enough to remind everyone that provisions are rarely dignified.</p><p>It can become eggs, supper, barter, or tomorrow&#39;s worse camp argument depending on how the day goes.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 2 cp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Chicken</strong></p><p>A live chicken trussed for travel, noisy enough to remind everyone that provisions are rarely dignified. It can become eggs, supper, barter, or tomorrow&#39;s worse camp argument de...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":8,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"cp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"chicken","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"TM9VmwPoJBHqJzqK\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"","su