{"_id":"TWFS1BtruQeE10BY","name":"Stone of Controlling Earth Elementals","type":"consumable","img":"modules/infinity-dnd5e/assets/item-art/unique/stone-of-controlling-earth-elementals-TWFS1BtruQeE10BY.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"TWFS1BtruQeE10BY\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Stone of Controlling Earth Elementals</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item</em></p>\n<p>If the stone is touching the ground, you can use an action to speak the stone's command word and summon an @Compendium[dnd5e.monsters.sApYLZj9PTZ40wJr]{Earth Elemental}, as if you had cast the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.1LkZvINag7KqBmDR]{Conjure Elemental} spell. The stone can't be used this way again until the next dawn.</p>\n<p>The stone weighs 5 pounds.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Trinket</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 8,000 gp</li><li>1 use(s), recovers day</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Stone of Controlling Earth Elementals</strong></p><p>Wondrous item If the stone is touching the ground, you can use an action to speak the stone&#39;s command word and summon an @Compendium[dnd5e.monsters.sApYLZj9PTZ40wJr]{Earth Eleme...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":5,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":8000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[{"period":"day","type":"recoverAll"}],"autoDestroy":false,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"TWFS1BtruQeE10BY\"><p><em>A trinket awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trinket is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. The workmanship suggests it deserves careful study before anyone relies on it.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trinket</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"trinket","subtype":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"utility","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"condition":"Command word.","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Use Stone of Controlling Earth Elementals."},"duration":{"concentration":false,"value":"1","units":"hour","special":"","override":false},"effects":[],"range":{"value":"90","units":"ft","special":"","override":false},"target":{"template":{"count":"","contiguous":false,"type":"square","size":"10","width":"","height":"","units":"ft"},"affects":{"count":"","type":"","choice":false,"special":""},"prompt":true,"override":false},"uses":{"spent":0,"max":"","recovery":[]},"roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":false},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionText":"","macroData":{"name":"","command":""},"ignoreTraits":{"idi":false,"idr":false,"idv":false,"ida":false},"midiProperties":{"ignoreTraits":[],"triggeredActivityId":"none","triggeredActivityConditionText":"","triggeredActivityTargets":"targets","triggeredActivityRollAs":"self","forceDialog":false,"confirmTar