{"_id":"V5UAjT3ed6sDNtgm","name":"Crowbar","type":"loot","img":"icons/tools/hand/pickaxe-steel-white.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"V5UAjT3ed6sDNtgm\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Crowbar</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A heavy iron crowbar with one flattened end and enough leverage to persuade doors, lids, and stubborn stones.</p><p>Burglars, laborers, and dungeon delvers all value it for the same simple reason: some things only open after an argument.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 2 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Crowbar</strong></p><p>A heavy iron crowbar with one flattened end and enough leverage to persuade doors, lids, and stubborn stones. Burglars, laborers, and dungeon delvers all value it for the same s...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":5,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"crowbar","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"V5UAjT3ed6sDNtgm\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by worked metal, balance, and edge finish. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: worked metal, balance, and edge finish</li><li>Identification state: Unide