{"name":"Cow","type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"VEyHiaiFe3RIFDHT\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Cow</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A creature for large-area farmers, cows require large areas of flat grazing meaning they are not as common as other livestock. However, they live longer, and give far more milk. They are also a source for much more durable leather that is less prone to cracking and is resistant to heat and dirt.</p>\n<p>Depending in the gender and breed, adult cows can weigh between 1,000 and 1,800 pounds.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 10 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Cow</strong></p><p>A creature for large-area farmers, cows require large areas of flat grazing meaning they are not as common as other livestock. However, they live longer, and give far more milk....</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1400,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":10,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"cow","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"VEyHiaiFe3RIFDHT\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by freshness, aroma, and preparation. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: freshness,