{"_id":"VwJjuNbBf2KHMPrY","name":"Cloak of Arachnida","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/back/cloak-heavy-fur-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"VwJjuNbBf2KHMPrY\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Cloak of Arachnida</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>This fine garment is made of black silk interwoven with faint silvery threads. While wearing it, you gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You have resistance to poison damage.</li>\n<li>You have a climbing speed equal to your walking speed.</li>\n<li>You can move up, down, and across vertical surfaces and upside down along ceilings, while leaving your hands free.</li>\n<li>You can't be caught in webs of any sort and can move through webs as if they were difficult terrain.</li>\n<li>You can use an action to cast the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.UJJu9c2UvCzVljiP]{Web} spell (save DC 13). The web created by the spell fills twice its normal area. Once used, this property of the cloak can't be used again until the next dawn.</li>\n</ul></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 5,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>1 use(s), recovers day</li><li>Activities: Save</li><li>Automated effects: 1 passive</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Cloak of Arachnida</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement) This fine garment is made of black silk interwoven with faint silvery threads. While wearing it, you gain the following benefits: You have r...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"q