{"_id":"WFQS2vT8ddrFjTJg","name":"Parchment","type":"loot","img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-symbol-circle-gold-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"WFQS2vT8ddrFjTJg\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Parchment</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A trimmed sheet of cured parchment tougher than paper and better suited to records meant to survive handling.</p><p>Scribes favor it for contracts, maps, and anything important enough to outlast damp weather and bad storage.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 1 sp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Parchment</strong></p><p>A trimmed sheet of cured parchment tougher than paper and better suited to records meant to survive handling. Scribes favor it for contracts, maps, and anything important enough...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1,"denomination":"sp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"parchment","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"WFQS2vT8ddrFjTJg\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Iden