{"_id":"WwdpHLXGX5r8uZu5","name":"Leather Armor","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-quilted-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"WwdpHLXGX5r8uZu5\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Leather Armor</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>The breastplate and shoulder protectors of this armor are made of leather that has been stiffened by being boiled in oil. The rest of the armor is made of softer and more flexible materials.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment, Leather</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 10 gp</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Leather Armor</strong></p><p>The breastplate and shoulder protectors of this armor are made of leather that has been stiffened by being boiled in oil. The rest of the armor is made of softer and more flexib...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":10,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":10,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","spent":0,"recovery":[]},"armor":{"value":11,"dex":null,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"identifier":"leather-armor","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"WwdpHLXGX5r8uZu5\"><p><em>A leather armor awaiting identification.</