{"_id":"XGAWqtmhK6SYBL6A","name":"Goggles of Night","type":"equipment","img":"icons/magic/control/hypnosis-mesmerism-eye.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"XGAWqtmhK6SYBL6A\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Goggles of Night</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item</em></p>\n<p>While wearing these dark lenses, you have darkvision out to a range of 60 feet. If you already have darkvision, wearing the goggles increases its range by 60 feet.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 1,500 gp</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 passive</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Goggles of Night</strong></p><p>Wondrous item While wearing these dark lenses, you have darkvision out to a range of 60 feet. If you already have darkvision, wearing the goggles increases its range by 60 feet.</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1500,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","spent":0,"recovery":[]},"armor":{"value":0,"dex":0,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"identifier":"goggles-of-night","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"XGAWqtmhK6SYBL6A\"><p><em>