{"_id":"XXLznzi3rlanMhTM","name":"Crossbow Bolt +3","type":"consumable","img":"icons/weapons/ammunition/arrows-bodkin-yellow-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"XXLznzi3rlanMhTM\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Crossbow Bolt +3</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>This ammunition is used for all varieties of crossbow and is typically a short metal shaft with a narrow piercing tip. It has been imbued with magic.</p>\n<p>You have a bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this piece of magic ammunition. Once it hits a target, the ammunition is no longer magical.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Ammo</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 400 gp</li><li>Activities: Attack</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Crossbow Bolt +3</strong></p><p>This ammunition is used for all varieties of crossbow and is typically a short metal shaft with a narrow piercing tip. It has been imbued with magic. You have a bonus to attack...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.075,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":400,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"veryRare","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":false,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"bonus":"","types":["piercing"],"custom":{"enabled":true,"formula":"3"},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":null,"formula":""}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-