{"_id":"YjImJ3cVnArHH4ES","name":"Winged Boots","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/feet/boots-collared-simple-leather.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"YjImJ3cVnArHH4ES\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Winged Boots</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>While you wear these boots, you have a flying speed equal to your walking speed. You can use the boots to fly for up to 4 hours, all at once or in several shorter flights, each one using a minimum of 1 minute from the duration. If you are flying when the duration expires, you descend at a rate of 30 feet per round until you land.</p>\n<p>The boots regain 2 hours of flying capability for every 12 hours they aren't in use.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 2,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 applied</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Winged Boots</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement) While you wear these boots, you have a flying speed equal to your walking speed. You can use the boots to fly for up to 4 hours, all at once...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":null,"dex":null,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"va