{"_id":"YwlHI3BVJapz4a3E","name":"Playing Cards Set","type":"tool","img":"icons/sundries/gaming/playing-cards.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"YwlHI3BVJapz4a3E\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Playing Cards Set</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>This item encompasses a wide range of playing card types, both unmarked and marked.</p>\n<p>If you are proficient with a gaming set, you can add your proficiency bonus to ability checks you make to play a game with that set. Each type of gaming set requires a separate proficiency.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Tool</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 5 sp</li><li>Activities: Check</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Playing Cards Set</strong></p><p>This item encompasses a wide range of playing card types, both unmarked and marked. If you are proficient with a gaming set, you can add your proficiency bonus to ability checks...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"sp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"ability":"dex","chatFlavor":"","proficient":0,"bonus":"","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"YwlHI3BVJapz4a3E\"><p><em>A tool awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This tool is described by paper stock, ink, and binding. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details sti