{"_id":"aMnWi1WXWpxRHq4r","name":"Potion of Climbing","type":"consumable","img":"icons/consumables/potions/potion-vial-corked-labeled-purple.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"aMnWi1WXWpxRHq4r\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Potion of Climbing</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>The potion is separated into brown, silver, and gray layers resembling bands of stone. Shaking the bottle fails to mix the colors.</em></p>\n<p>When you drink this potion, you gain a climbing speed equal to your walking speed for 1 hour. During this time, you have advantage on Strength (Athletics) checks you make to climb. </p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Potion</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 180 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 applied</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Potion of Climbing</strong></p><p>The potion is separated into brown, silver, and gray layers resembling bands of stone. Shaking the bottle fails to mix the colors. When you drink this potion, you gain a climbin...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":180,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"