{"_id":"bqZ6NTLDCUB98YjV","name":"Potion of Gaseous Form","type":"consumable","img":"icons/consumables/potions/potion-bottle-skull-label-poison-teal.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"bqZ6NTLDCUB98YjV\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Potion of Gaseous Form</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>This potion's container seems to hold fog that moves and pours like water.</em></p>\n<p>When you drink this potion, you gain the effect of the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.2IWiZAJtOGDoKjiz]{Gaseous Form} spell for 1 hour (no concentration required) or until you end the effect as a bonus action. </p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Potion</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 300 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Potion of Gaseous Form</strong></p><p>This potion&#39;s container seems to hold fog that moves and pours like water. When you drink this potion, you gain the effect of the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.2IWiZAJtOGDoKjiz]{Gase...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":300,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identificat