{"name":"Flour","type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"cFvYCJinCypVCDhN\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Flour</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A sack of milled flour pale with starch and fine enough to dust everything nearby if handled carelessly.</p><p>Bakers, cooks, and siege planners all know humble staples like this keep people calmer than speeches do.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 2 cp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Flour</strong></p><p>A sack of milled flour pale with starch and fine enough to dust everything nearby if handled carelessly. Bakers, cooks, and siege planners all know humble staples like this keep...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"cp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"flour","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"cFvYCJinCypVCDhN\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by freshness, aroma, and preparation. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: freshness, aroma, and preparation</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"activities":{}},"f