{"folder":"9LJujCqZ6IrLO0Ai","name":"Alexandrite","type":"loot","_id":"dAwe0GD493qXmYAD","img":"icons/commodities/gems/gem-rough-cushion-purple-pink.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"dAwe0GD493qXmYAD\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Alexandrite</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A refined alexandrite whose color shifts from moss green to muted wine depending on the light.</p><p>Even a small stone commands attention because buyers know the trick is in the gem itself, not the setting around it.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure, Provision</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 200 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Alexandrite</strong></p><p>A refined alexandrite whose color shifts from moss green to muted wine depending on the light. Even a small stone commands attention because buyers know the trick is in the gem...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.01,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":200,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"identifier":"alexandrite","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"dAwe0GD493qXmYAD\"><p><em>A cut stone awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This cut stone is described by faceted surfaces and reflected light. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visib