{"folder":"pkppbaGlKM8FdE3V","name":"Ivory","type":"loot","_id":"eAtE9tnI4CxMLdCl","img":"icons/commodities/bones/horn-worn-white.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"eAtE9tnI4CxMLdCl\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Ivory</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A smooth section of ivory pale as old parchment and dense enough for carving, inlay, or ceremonial handles.</p><p>Merchants move it as a luxury material because crafters can turn even a modest piece into something princely.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 300 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Ivory</strong></p><p>A smooth section of ivory pale as old parchment and dense enough for carving, inlay, or ceremonial handles. Merchants move it as a luxury material because crafters can turn even...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":2,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":300,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"identifier":"ivory","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"eAtE9tnI4CxMLdCl\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition