{"_id":"eJY20LOs3pOkRDPl","name":"Block of Incense","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/stone/rock-chunk-pumice-white.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"eJY20LOs3pOkRDPl\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Block of Incense</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A compact block of incense pressed from resins, ash, and fragrant powders, meant to be shaved, crumbled, or burned in pinches.</p><p>Temples use it for ritual, wealthy homes use it for atmosphere, and travelers buy it whenever they need a room to smell more respectable than it is.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 1 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Block of Incense</strong></p><p>A compact block of incense pressed from resins, ash, and fragrant powders, meant to be shaved, crumbled, or burned in pinches. Temples use it for ritual, wealthy homes use it fo...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.5,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"block-of-incense","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"eJY20LOs3pOkRDPl\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</l