{"folder":"pkppbaGlKM8FdE3V","name":"Mithril Bar","type":"loot","_id":"eL2H4IxniOFn39gX","img":"icons/commodities/metal/ingot-stamped-silver.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"eL2H4IxniOFn39gX\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Mithril Bar</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A silvery-blue ingot of mithril light enough to feel almost suspicious in the hand.</p><p>Armorers and artificers pay well for bars like this because every ounce promises superior work without deadening weight.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 46 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Mithril Bar</strong></p><p>A silvery-blue ingot of mithril light enough to feel almost suspicious in the hand. Armorers and artificers pay well for bars like this because every ounce promises superior wor...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":46,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"identifier":"mithril-bar","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"eL2H4IxniOFn39gX\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</l