{"name":"Rusty Longsword","type":"weapon","img":"icons/weapons/swords/greatsword-crossguard-steel.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"ennPTzd70YVuAo8c\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Rusty Longsword</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A lengthy straight blade designed for slashing foes, the longsword is a highly versatile weapon that may also be wielded with two hands for more punishing strikes.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Weapon, Longsword</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 15 gp</li><li>Activities: Attack</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Rusty Longsword</strong></p><p>A lengthy straight blade designed for slashing foes, the longsword is a highly versatile weapon that may also be wielded with two hands for more punishing strikes.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":15,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"ft","reach":null},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"damage":{"versatile":{"number":1,"denomination":10,"bonus":"-1","types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false,"formula":""},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":null,"formula":""}},"base":{"number":1,"denomination":8,"bonus":"-1","types":["slashing"],"custom":{"enabled":false,"formula":""},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":null,"formula":""}}},"armor":{"value":10},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"properties":["ver"],"proficient":0,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"i