{"_id":"evSCq83oPhR0ZK4y","name":"Armor of Invulnerability","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-cuirass-steel-grey.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"evSCq83oPhR0ZK4y\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Armor of Invulnerability</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>(Requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>You have resistance to nonmagical damage while you wear this armor. Additionally, you can use an action to make yourself immune to nonmagical damage for 10 minutes or until you are no longer wearing the armor. Once this special action is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment, Plate</li><li>Rarity: Legendary</li><li>Value: 25,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 passive, 1 applied</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Armor of Invulnerability</strong></p><p>(Requires attunement) You have resistance to nonmagical damage while you wear this armor. Additionally, you can use an action to make yourself immune to nonmagical damage for 10...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":65,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":25000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"legendary","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":18,"dex":0,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":15,"proficient":0,"unidentified":{"description":"<section 