{"_id":"ewXgnWiYQhS8KArS","name":"Ring of Three Wishes","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/finger/ring-cabochon-gold-purple.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"ewXgnWiYQhS8KArS\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Ring of Three Wishes</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>While wearing this ring, you can use an action to expend 1 of its 3 charges to cast the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.3okM6Gn63zzEULkz]{Wish} spell from it. The ring becomes nonmagical when you use the last charge.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment, Ring</li><li>Rarity: Legendary</li><li>Value: 50,000 gp</li><li>3 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Ring of Three Wishes</strong></p><p>While wearing this ring, you can use an action to expend 1 of its 3 charges to cast the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.3okM6Gn63zzEULkz]{Wish} spell from it. The ring becomes nonmagic...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":50000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"legendary","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"3","recovery":[],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":0,"dex":0,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"ewXgnWiYQhS8KA