{"_id":"fbcQsOgWCjhEAGY7","name":"Efreeti Bottle","type":"consumable","img":"icons/consumables/potions/potion-flask-corked-orange.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"fbcQsOgWCjhEAGY7\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Efreeti Bottle</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item</em></p>\n<p>This painted brass bottle weighs 1 pound. When you use an action to remove the stopper, a cloud of thick smoke flows out of the bottle. At the end of your turn, the smoke disappears with a flash of harmless fire, and an @Compendium[dnd5e.monsters.LTomFUTBrkRi0Pj5]{Efreeti} appears in an unoccupied space within 30 feet of you.</p>\n<p>The first time the bottle is opened, the GM rolls to determine what happens from the @Compendium[dnd5e.tables.yZMFNfocj5qyVuOC]{Efreeti Bottle} table.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Trinket</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 40,000 gp</li><li>4 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Efreeti Bottle</strong></p><p>Wondrous item This painted brass bottle weighs 1 pound. When you use an action to remove the stopper, a cloud of thick smoke flows out of the bottle. At the end of your turn, th...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":40000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"veryRare","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"4","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"repla