{"_id":"gTRFQLdVD1gsKtPi","name":"Potion of Growth","type":"consumable","img":"icons/consumables/potions/potion-tube-corked-glowing-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"gTRFQLdVD1gsKtPi\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Potion of Growth</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>The red in the potion's liquid continuously expands from a tiny bead to color the clear liquid around it and then contracts.  Shaking the bottle fails to interrupt this process.</em></p>\n<p>When you drink this potion, you gain the \"enlarge\" effect of the @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.WahI41a3goVUg0x1]{Enlarge/Reduce} spell for 1d4 hours (no concentration required).</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Potion</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 270 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Potion of Growth</strong></p><p>The red in the potion&#39;s liquid continuously expands from a tiny bead to color the clear liquid around it and then contracts. Shaking the bottle fails to interrupt this process....</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":270,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\