{"_id":"hSY1b8yi8JWw2blf","name":"Boots of Striding and Springing","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/feet/boots-collared-rounded-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"hSY1b8yi8JWw2blf\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Boots of Striding and Springing</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>While you wear these boots, your walking speed becomes 30 feet, unless your walking speed is higher, and your speed isn't reduced if you are encumbered or wearing heavy armor. In addition, you can jump three times the normal distance, though you can't jump farther than your remaining movement would allow.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 2,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 passive</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Boots of Striding and Springing</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement) While you wear these boots, your walking speed becomes 30 feet, unless your walking speed is higher, and your speed isn&#39;t reduced if you are...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","spent":0,"recovery":[]},"armor":{"value":0,"dex":0,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"identifier":"boots-of-st