{"name":"Gold","type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"hvAn2a6ukt1NpGU3\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Gold</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>Gold is the king of currency for many civilizations. Usually more common than the likes of platinum, but nowhere near as common as other metals like iron, it occupies a sweet spot in rarity and unreactiveness.</p>\n<p>Unlike silver, gold can be found more easily on the surface. Both surface and underground mining can be extremely profitable. Gold rushes can and have been a source a great happiness and huge tragedy.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 50 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Gold</strong></p><p>Gold is the king of currency for many civilizations. Usually more common than the likes of platinum, but nowhere near as common as other metals like iron, it occupies a sweet sp...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":50,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"gold","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"hvAn2a6ukt1NpGU3\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good