{"name":"Cotton","type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"iAhvVUZD5s0ltpSX\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Cotton</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A square yard of cotton of average quality and weight. Used for all manner of items and clothing.</p>\n<p>Far lighter, more comfortable, and easier to work with than canvas; however, the comparatively more delicate crop means it is accordingly more expensive and potentially harder to come by.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 5 sp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Cotton</strong></p><p>A square yard of cotton of average quality and weight. Used for all manner of items and clothing. Far lighter, more comfortable, and easier to work with than canvas; however, the...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.5,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"sp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"cotton","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"iAhvVUZD5s0ltpSX\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by stitching, wear, and fitted seams. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: stitching, wear, and fitted seams</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},