{"_id":"iOMRrzfzFCfPGuD6","name":"Bag of Sand","type":"loot","img":"icons/containers/bags/coinpouch-simple-tan.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"iOMRrzfzFCfPGuD6\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Bag of Sand</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A small bag of sand used by the scholarly to dry freshly inked letters and correspondence quickly and safely for quick dispatch.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 1 sp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Bag of Sand</strong></p><p>A small bag of sand used by the scholarly to dry freshly inked letters and correspondence quickly and safely for quick dispatch.</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.5,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1,"denomination":"sp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"bag-of-sand","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"iOMRrzfzFCfPGuD6\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"activities":{}},"effects":[],"fo