{"_id":"jJU8vFhHLQeKe2wu","name":"Gem of Seeing","type":"consumable","img":"icons/commodities/gems/gem-rough-rose-teal.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"jJU8vFhHLQeKe2wu\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Gem of Seeing</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>This gem has 3 charges. As an action, you can speak the gem's command word and expend 1 charge. For the next 10 minutes, you have truesight out to 120 feet when you peer through the gem.</p>\n<p>The gem regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Trinket</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 5,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>3 use(s), recovers lr</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 applied</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Gem of Seeing</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement) This gem has 3 charges. As an action, you can speak the gem&#39;s command word and expend 1 charge. For the next 10 minutes, you have truesight...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"3","recovery":[{"period":"lr","type":"formula","formula":"1d3"}],"autoDestroy":false,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-desc