{"_id":"kdkpSZMUHGXGM15H","name":"Signet Ring","type":"loot","img":"icons/equipment/finger/ring-cabochon-gold-orange.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"kdkpSZMUHGXGM15H\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Signet Ring</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A metal ring engraved with a seal meant to press identity, rank, or allegiance into wax and memory alike.</p><p>Objects like this matter because they can open doors long before anyone reads the letter.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure, Ring</li><li>Value: 5 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Signet Ring</strong></p><p>A metal ring engraved with a seal meant to press identity, rank, or allegiance into wax and memory alike. Objects like this matter because they can open doors long before anyone...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"signet-ring","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"kdkpSZMUHGXGM15H\"><p><em>A ring awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This ring is described by faceted surfaces and reflected light. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Ring</li><li>Inspection cues: faceted surfaces and reflected light</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></secti