{"_id":"l794iywHk8Wc6Uvi","name":"Book of Lore","type":"loot","img":"icons/sundries/books/book-plain-orange.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"l794iywHk8Wc6Uvi\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Book of Lore</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A bound volume of histories, myths, and copied notes gathered around one field of old lore.</p><p>Scholars prize books like this for the references they contain, while swindlers prize them for how authoritative they look.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure, Book</li><li>Value: 25 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Book of Lore</strong></p><p>A bound volume of histories, myths, and copied notes gathered around one field of old lore. Scholars prize books like this for the references they contain, while swindlers prize...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":5,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":25,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"book-of-lore","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"l794iywHk8Wc6Uvi\"><p><em>A book awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This book is described by paper stock, ink, and binding. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Book</li><li>Inspection cues: paper stock, ink, and binding</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></sec