{"_id":"lN1VbnGFo3HNZXNb","name":"Half Plate Armor of Resistance","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-layered-steel-black.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"lN1VbnGFo3HNZXNb\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Half Plate Armor of Resistance</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>(Requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>You have resistance to one type of damage while you wear this armor. The GM chooses the type or determines it randomly from the @Compendium[dnd5e.tables.VRqG3F72ebgNHyVR]{Armor of Resistance} table.\n</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment, Halfplate</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 6,750 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Half Plate Armor of Resistance</strong></p><p>(Requires attunement) You have resistance to one type of damage while you wear this armor. The GM chooses the type or determines it randomly from the @Compendium[dnd5e.tables.VR...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":40,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":6750,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":15,"dex":2,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"lN1VbnGFo3HNZXNb\"><p><em>A halfplate armor awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This halfplate armor is described by worked metal, balance, and edge finish. The workmanship suggests it deserves careful study before anyone relies on it.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Halfplate Armor</li><li>Inspection cues: worked metal, balance, and edge finish</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"medium","baseItem":"halfplate"},"container":null,"properties":["stealthDisadvantage"],"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"utility","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"condition":"","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Use Half Plate Armor of Resistance"},"duration":{"concentration":false,"value":"","units":"inst","special":"","override":false},"effects":[],"range":{"units":"self","special":"","override":false},"target":{"template":{"count":"","contiguous":false,"type":"","size":"","width":"","height":"","units":""},"affects":{"count":"","type":"","choice":false,"special":""},"prompt":true,"override":false},"uses":{"spent":0,"max":"","recovery":[]},"roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":false},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionText":"","macroData":{"name":"","command":""},"ignoreTraits":{"idi":false,"idr":false,"idv":false,"ida":false},"midiProperties":{"ignoreTraits":[],"triggeredActivityId":"none","triggeredActivityConditionText":"","triggeredActivityTargets":"targets","triggeredActivityRollAs":"self","forceDialog":false,"confirmTargets":"default","autoTargetType":"any","autoTargetAction":"default","automationOnly":false,"otherActivityCompatible":true,"identifier":"","displayActivityName":false,"rollMode":"default","chooseEffects":false,"toggleEffect":false,"ignoreFullCover