{"_id":"luTJgPXN5n0EN7iy","name":"Vicious Whip","type":"weapon","img":"icons/weapons/misc/whip-red-yellow.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"luTJgPXN5n0EN7iy\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Vicious Whip</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A tensile lash made of leather, cord, or chain which can lash out at nearby enemies, dealing lacerations and harrying them from a distance.</p>\n<p>When you roll a 20 on your attack roll with this magic weapon, your critical hit deals an extra 2d6 damage of the weapon's type.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Weapon, Whip</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 750 gp</li><li>Activities: Attack</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Vicious Whip</strong></p><p>A tensile lash made of leather, cord, or chain which can lash out at nearby enemies, dealing lacerations and harrying them from a distance. When you roll a 20 on your attack rol...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":750,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"ft","reach":null},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"damage":{"versatile":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"bonus":"","types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false,"formula":""},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":null,"formula":""}},"base":{"number":1,"denomination":4,"bonus":"","types":["slashing"],"custom":{"enabled":false,"formula":""},"scaling":{"mode":"","number":null,"formula":""}}},"armor":{"value":10},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"properties":["fin","rch","mgc"],"proficient":0,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"luTJgPXN5n0EN7iy\"><p><em>A whip weapon awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This whip weapon is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Small details imply more value than a quick glance can confirm.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Whip Weapon</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"martialM","baseItem":"whip"},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"attack","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"condition":"","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Attack with Vicious Whip."},"duration":{"concentration":false,"value":"","units":"inst","special":"","override":false},"effects":[],"range":{"units":"ft","special":"","override":false},"target":{"template":{"count":"","contiguous":false,"type":"","size":"","width":"","height":"","units":""},"affects":{"count":"","type":"","choice":false,"special":""},"prompt":true,"override":false},"uses":{"spent":0,"max":"","recovery":[]},"attack":{"ability":"","bonus":"","critical":{"threshold":null},"flat":false,"type":{"value":"melee","classification":"weapon"}},"damage":{"critical":{"bonus":"2d6"},"includeBase":true,"parts":[]},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionText":"","macroData":{"name":"","command":""},"ignoreTraits":{"idi":false,"idr":false,"idv":false,"ida":false},"midiProperties":{"ignoreTraits":[],"triggeredActivityId":"none","triggeredActivityConditionText":"","triggeredActivityTargets":"targets","triggeredAct