{"name":"Cloves","type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"mCKdF0P09Wo5hmqx\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Cloves</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A strong spice treasured by both chefs and distillers, working well to flavor meat and stews, rich sauces, warm beverages like cider and chai tea, bread, cheeses, and sweet desserts like pies and fruitcakes.</p>\n<p>Cloves are the rich, dried, unopened buds of the Syzygium aromaticum, an evergreen tree in the myrtle family.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 3 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Cloves</strong></p><p>A strong spice treasured by both chefs and distillers, working well to flavor meat and stews, rich sauces, warm beverages like cider and chai tea, bread, cheeses, and sweet dess...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":3,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"cloves","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"mCKdF0P09Wo5hmqx\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by freshness, aroma, and preparation. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: freshness, aroma, and preparation</li><li>Identification state: Uniden