{"folder":"W0I33XtZCMuVhQH6","name":"Scarlet Token","type":"loot","_id":"mcmslMRPq0C6m4ze","img":"modules/infinity-dnd5e/assets/item-art/unique/scarlet-token-mcmslMRPq0C6m4ze.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"mcmslMRPq0C6m4ze\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Scarlet Token</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A lacquer-red token stamped with an old sigil and backed in thin gilt metal.</p><p>Whether it once served as a festival pass, military marker, or house favor, it now trades as a curiosity with enough history to invite lies.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 25 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Scarlet Token</strong></p><p>A lacquer-red token stamped with an old sigil and backed in thin gilt metal. Whether it once served as a festival pass, military marker, or house favor, it now trades as a curio...</p>"},"identifier":"new-item","source":{"revision":1,"rules":"2024"},"identified":true,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"mcmslMRPq0C6m4ze\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by faceted surfaces and reflected light. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: faceted surfaces and reflected light</li><li>Identification state: Unidentif