{"_id":"nsXZejlmgalj4he9","name":"Ring Mail","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-metal-scaled-grey.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"nsXZejlmgalj4he9\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Ring Mail</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>This armor is leather armor with heavy rings sewn into it. The rings help reinforce the armor against blows from swords and axes. Ring mail is inferior to chain mail, and it's usually worn only by those who can't afford better armor.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment, Ringmail</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 30 gp</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Ring Mail</strong></p><p>This armor is leather armor with heavy rings sewn into it. The rings help reinforce the armor against blows from swords and axes. Ring mail is inferior to chain mail, and it&#39;s u...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":40,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":30,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":14,"dex":0,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"nsXZejlmgalj4he9\"><p><em>A ringmail armo