{"_id":"oY8KbpGmB5H2Deoy","name":"Silk Rope (50 ft.)","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/survival/rope-wrapped-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"oY8KbpGmB5H2Deoy\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Silk Rope (50 ft.)</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A lighter, finer rope woven from silk for climbers, burglars, and anyone willing to pay extra for strength without bulk.</p><p>It feels almost too refined for hard use until it saves effort on every ascent and packs smaller than hemp ever will.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Trinket</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 10 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Check, Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Silk Rope (50 ft.)</strong></p><p>A lighter, finer rope woven from silk for climbers, burglars, and anyone willing to pay extra for strength without bulk. It feels almost too refined for hard use until it saves...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":5,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":10,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":false,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"oY8KbpGmB5H2Deoy\"><p><em>A trinket awaiting