{"name":"Platinum","type":"loot","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"pcIwvfpEEjXRpBJe\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Platinum</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>Far rarer than gold, platinum may either be treated as the pinnacle of wealth, or the vestige of a bygone age that may be met with distrust or envy.</p>\n<p>Unlike gold, platinum is almost exclusively mined underground.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 500 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Platinum</strong></p><p>Far rarer than gold, platinum may either be treated as the pinnacle of wealth, or the vestige of a bygone age that may be met with distrust or envy. Unlike gold, platinum is alm...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":500,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"platinum","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"pcIwvfpEEjXRpBJe\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"container":null,"properties":[],"type":{"value