{"_id":"qRMQH8lRE42JkugE","name":"Mithral Half Plate Armor","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-layered-steel-black.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"qRMQH8lRE42JkugE\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Mithral Half Plate Armor</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>Mithral is a light, flexible metal. A mithral chain shirt or breastplate can be worn under normal clothes. If the armor normally imposes disadvantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks or has a Strength requirement, the mithral version of the armor doesn't.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment, Halfplate</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 1,550 gp</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Mithral Half Plate Armor</strong></p><p>Mithral is a light, flexible metal. A mithral chain shirt or breastplate can be worn under normal clothes. If the armor normally imposes disadvantage on Dexterity (Stealth) chec...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":40,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1550,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","spent":0,"recovery":[]},"armor":{"value":15,"dex":2,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"identifier":"mithral-half-plate-armor","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-i