{"_id":"qw05Om9XWqTMoio2","name":"Ring of the Ram","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/finger/ring-band-engraved-scrolls-silver.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"qw05Om9XWqTMoio2\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Ring of the Ram</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>(Requires attunement)</em></p><p>This ring has 3 charges, and it regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. While wearing the ring, you can use an action to expend 1 to 3 of its charges to attack one creature you can see within 60 feet of you. The ring produces a spectral ram's head and makes its attack roll with a +7 bonus. On a hit, for each charge you spend, the target takes 2d10 force damage and is pushed 5 feet away from you.</p><p>Alternatively, you can expend 1 to 3 of the ring's charges as an action to try to break an object you can see within 60 feet of you that isn't being worn or carried. The ring makes a Strength check with a +5 bonus for each charge you spend.</p><section class=\"secret foundry-note\" id=\"secret-hrWDEE29xrHp8mhB\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The Other Formula is set to calculate 1d20 + 5 for one charge expended to make the Strength check. Please +5 per any extra charge as required.</p></section></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment, Ring</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 5,000 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>3 use(s), recovers lr</li><li>Activities: Attack, Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Ring of the Ram</strong></p><p>(Requires attunement) This ring has 3 charges, and it regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. While wearing the ring, you can use an action to expend 1 to 3 of its charges t...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5000,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"3","recovery":[{"period":"lr","type":"formula","formula":"1d3"}],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":0,"dex":0,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficient":0,"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"qw05Om9XWqTMoio2\"><p><em>A ring equipment awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This ring equipment is described by paper stock, ink, and binding. The workmanship suggests it deserves careful study before anyone relies on it.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Ring Equipment</li><li>Inspection cues: paper stock, ink, and binding</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"trinket","baseItem":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"attack","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"condition":"","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Attack with Ring of the Ram."},"duration":{"concentration":false,"value":"","units":"inst","special":"","override":false},"effects":[],"range":{"value":"60","units":"ft","special":"","override":false},"target":{"template":{"count":"","contiguous":false,"type":"","size":"","width":"","height":"","units":""},"affects":{"count":"","type":"self","choice":false,"special":""},"prompt":true,