{"_id":"skUih6tBvcBbORzA","name":"Mason's Tools","type":"tool","img":"icons/tools/hand/hammer-and-nail.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"skUih6tBvcBbORzA\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Mason&#39;s Tools</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>These special tools include the items needed to pursue a craft or trade in masonry.</p>\n<p>Proficiency with a set of artisan's tools lets you add your proficiency bonus to any ability checks you make using the tools in your craft. Each type of artisan's tools requires a separate proficiency.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Tool, Mason</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 10 gp</li><li>Activities: Check</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Mason&#39;s Tools</strong></p><p>These special tools include the items needed to pursue a craft or trade in masonry. Proficiency with a set of artisan&#39;s tools lets you add your proficiency bonus to any ability...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":8,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":10,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"ability":"wis","chatFlavor":"","proficient":0,"bonus":"","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"skUih6tBvcBbORzA\"><p><em>A mason tool awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This mason tool is described by worked metal, balance, and edge finish. Its practical use is apparent, b