{"_id":"tfDxZIKDpOkz6pbx","name":"Grappling Hook","type":"loot","img":"icons/weapons/sickles/sickle-hooked-wood.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"tfDxZIKDpOkz6pbx\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Grappling Hook</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A four-clawed iron grappling hook designed to bite ledges, rails, and rough stone when thrown with rope attached.</p><p>It turns walls into suggestions and bad climbs into merely risky ones.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 2 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Grappling Hook</strong></p><p>A four-clawed iron grappling hook designed to bite ledges, rails, and rough stone when thrown with rope attached. It turns walls into suggestions and bad climbs into merely risk...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":4,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"grappling-hook","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"tfDxZIKDpOkz6pbx\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by grain, polish, and handling marks. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: grain, polish, and handling marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></sectio