{"_id":"uuh4UH3Jx5CsFjdA","name":"Perfume","type":"loot","img":"icons/consumables/potions/bottle-bulb-corked-purple.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"uuh4UH3Jx5CsFjdA\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Perfume</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A stoppered glass vial of concentrated perfume blended from flowers, oils, and whatever memory someone wanted to bottle.</p><p>It can dress a noble, disguise a room, or announce a purse with better taste than sense.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 5 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Perfume</strong></p><p>A stoppered glass vial of concentrated perfume blended from flowers, oils, and whatever memory someone wanted to bottle. It can dress a noble, disguise a room, or announce a pur...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"perfume","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"uuh4UH3Jx5CsFjdA\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by sealed glass, color, and residue. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: sealed glass, color, and residue</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></