{"_id":"vJvb6fx3JVPmhG8x","name":"Merchant's Scale","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/currency/coins-assorted-mix-silver.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"vJvb6fx3JVPmhG8x\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Merchant&#39;s Scale</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A scale includes a small balance, pans, and a suitable assortment of weights up to 2 pounds. With it, you can measure the exact weight of small objects, such as raw precious metals or trade goods, to help determine their worth.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure, Provision</li><li>Value: 5 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Merchant&#39;s Scale</strong></p><p>A scale includes a small balance, pans, and a suitable assortment of weights up to 2 pounds. With it, you can measure the exact weight of small objects, such as raw precious met...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"identifier":"merchants-scale","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"vJvb6fx3JVPmhG8x\"><p><em>A provision awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This provision is described by freshness, aroma, and preparation. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Provision</li><li>Inspection cues: freshness, aroma, and 