{"folder":"HH9fE5IrClbdRl6l","name":"Broken Weapon","type":"loot","_id":"w7XZPoXNp0aEd0rk","img":"icons/weapons/swords/sword-guard-serrated.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"w7XZPoXNp0aEd0rk\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Broken Weapon</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A broken weapon salvaged for its metal, fittings, or whatever story clings to the ruin.</p><p>Smiths buy pieces like this by weight, while sentimental fools buy them by the tale of who last swung them.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Value: 5 cp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Broken Weapon</strong></p><p>A broken weapon salvaged for its metal, fittings, or whatever story clings to the ruin. Smiths buy pieces like this by weight, while sentimental fools buy them by the tale of wh...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":2,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":5,"denomination":"cp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"identifier":"broken-weapon","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"w7XZPoXNp0aEd0rk\"><p><em>A trade good awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This trade good is described by worked metal, balance, and edge finish. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Trade Good</li><li>Inspection cues: worked metal, balanc