{"_id":"woWZ1sO5IUVGzo58","name":"Thieves' Tools","type":"tool","img":"icons/tools/hand/lockpicks-steel-grey.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"woWZ1sO5IUVGzo58\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Thieves&#39; Tools</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>This set of tools includes a small file, a set of lock picks, a small mirror mounted on a metal handle, a set of narrow-bladed scissors, and a pair of pliers. Proficiency with these tools lets you add your proficiency bonus to any ability checks you make to disarm traps or open locks.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Tool, Thief</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 25 gp</li><li>Activities: Check</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Thieves&#39; Tools</strong></p><p>This set of tools includes a small file, a set of lock picks, a small mirror mounted on a metal handle, a set of narrow-bladed scissors, and a pair of pliers. Proficiency with t...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":1,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":25,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"ability":"dex","chatFlavor":"","proficient":0,"bonus":"","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"woWZ1sO5IUVGzo58\"><p><em>A thief tool awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This thief tool is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Its practical use is apparent, 