{"_id":"wwNpAz2KMukovewN","name":"Necklace of Adaptation","type":"equipment","img":"icons/equipment/neck/pendant-faceted-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"wwNpAz2KMukovewN\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Necklace of Adaptation</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p><em>Wondrous item, (requires attunement)</em></p>\n<p>While wearing this necklace, you can breathe normally in any environment, and you have advantage on saving throws made against harmful gases and vapors (such as @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.LkvI11Uue774QBKZ]{Cloudkill} and @Compendium[dnd5e.spells.TwlD4PLcltv7Xh7j]{Stinking Cloud} effects, inhaled poisons, and the breath weapons of some dragons).</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Equipment, Jewelry</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 1,500 gp</li><li>Requires attunement</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 passive</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Necklace of Adaptation</strong></p><p>Wondrous item, (requires attunement) While wearing this necklace, you can breathe normally in any environment, and you have advantage on saving throws made against harmful gases...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"SRD 5.1","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.01,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1500,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"required","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"cover":null,"crewed":false,"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"armor":{"value":0,"dex":0,"magicalBonus":null},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0,"dt":null,"conditions":""},"speed":{"value":null,"conditions":""},"strength":null,"proficien