{"folder":"9LJujCqZ6IrLO0Ai","name":"Topaz","type":"loot","_id":"zFfgQVDvpvpEkMb7","img":"icons/commodities/gems/gem-faceted-hexagon-orange.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"zFfgQVDvpvpEkMb7\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Topaz</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A golden topaz with steady color and a disciplined cut that throws warm light rather than wild sparkle.</p><p>Jewelers like stones like this because they lend nobility to a piece without overwhelming the metalwork around them.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 50 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Topaz</strong></p><p>A golden topaz with steady color and a disciplined cut that throws warm light rather than wild sparkle. Jewelers like stones like this because they lend nobility to a piece with...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.01,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":50,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"identifier":"topaz","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"zFfgQVDvpvpEkMb7\"><p><em>A cut stone awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This cut stone is described by faceted surfaces and reflected light. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Cut Stone</li><li>Ins