{"_id":"5e1xTohkzqFqbYH4","name":"Flame Strike","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"5e1xTohkzqFqbYH4\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Flame Strike</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A vertical column of divine fire roars down from the heavens in a location you specify. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high Cylinder centered on a point within range must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 4d6 fire damage and 4d6 radiant damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the fire damage or the radiant damage (your choice) increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 5th.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Flame Strike</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 5,000 gp</li><li>Activities: Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Flame Strike</strong></p><p>A vertical column of divine fire roars down from the heavens in a location you specify. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high Cylinder centered on a point within range...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"action","condition":"","value":1},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"target":{"affects":{"choice":false},"template":{"units":"ft","type":"cylinder","size":"10","contiguous":false}},"range":{"value":"60","units":"ft"},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"level":5,"school":"evo","materials":{"value":"A pinch of sulfur","con