{"_id":"6g3WLOZ2u0EbaLAd","name":"Hypnotic Pattern","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"6g3WLOZ2u0EbaLAd\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Hypnotic Pattern</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>You create a twisting pattern of colors that weaves through the air inside a 30-foot cube within range. The pattern appears for a moment and vanishes. Each creature in the area who sees the pattern must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the creature becomes &amp;Reference[charmed] for the duration. While charmed by this spell, the creature is &amp;Reference[incapacitated] and has a speed of 0.</p><p>The spell ends for an affected creature if it takes any damage or if someone else uses an action to shake the creature out of its stupor.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Hypnotic Pattern</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 500 gp</li><li>Activities: Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Hypnotic Pattern</strong></p><p>You create a twisting pattern of colors that weaves through the air inside a 30-foot cube within range. The pattern appears for a moment and vanishes. Each creature in the area...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"action","condition":"","value":1},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"minute"},"target":{"affects":{"choice":false},"template":{"units":"ft","type":"cube","size":"30","contiguous":false}},"range":{"value":"120","units":"ft"},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"level":3,"school":"ill","materials":{"va