{"_id":"95K2aUhAGV9qXjnf","name":"Bane","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"95K2aUhAGV9qXjnf\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Bane</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>Up to three creatures of your choice that you can see within range must make Charisma saving throws. Whenever a target that fails this saving throw makes an attack roll or a saving throw before the spell ends, the target must roll a d4 and subtract the number rolled from the attack roll or saving throw.</p>\n<p><strong>Higher Levels.</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 1st.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Bane</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 50 gp</li><li>Activities: Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Bane</strong></p><p>Up to three creatures of your choice that you can see within range must make Charisma saving throws. Whenever a target that fails this saving throw makes an attack roll or a sav...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"action","condition":"","value":1},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"minute"},"target":{"affects":{"type":"creature","count":"3","choice":false},"template":{"units":"","contiguous":false}},"range":{"value":"30","units":"ft"},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"level":1,"school":"enc","materials":{"value":"A drop of blood","consumed":false,"cost":0,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"proper