{"_id":"LTDNWoFVJNLjiiNa","name":"Arcane Sword","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"LTDNWoFVJNLjiiNa\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Arcane Sword</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>You create a sword-shaped plane of force that hovers within range. It lasts for the Duration.</p><p>When the sword appears, you make a melee spell Attack against a target of your choice within 5 feet of the sword. On a hit, the target takes 3d10 force damage. Until the spell ends, you can use a Bonus Action on each of your turns to move the sword up to 20 feet to a spot you can see and repeat this Attack against the same target or a different one.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Arcane Sword</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 25,000 gp</li><li>Activities: Summon</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Arcane Sword</strong></p><p>You create a sword-shaped plane of force that hovers within range. It lasts for the Duration. When the sword appears, you make a melee spell Attack against a target of your choi...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"action","condition":"","value":1},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"minute"},"target":{"affects":{"type":"creature","count":"1","choice":false},"template":{"units":"","contiguous":false}},"range":{"value":"60","units":"ft"},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"level":7,"school":"evo","materials":{"value":"A miniature platinum sword with a grip and pommel of copper and zinc, worth 250gp","consumed":false,"co