{"_id":"MK6gpQMeDFo0cP9f","name":"Continual Flame","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"MK6gpQMeDFo0cP9f\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Continual Flame</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A flame, equivalent in brightness to a torch, springs forth from an object that you touch. The effect looks like a regular flame, but it creates no heat and doesn't use oxygen. A continual flame can be covered or hidden but not smothered or quenched.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Continual Flame</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 250 gp</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Continual Flame</strong></p><p>A flame, equivalent in brightness to a torch, springs forth from an object that you touch. The effect looks like a regular flame, but it creates no heat and doesn&#39;t use oxygen....</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"action","condition":"","value":1},"duration":{"value":"","units":"disp"},"target":{"affects":{"type":"object","count":"1","choice":false},"template":{"units":"","contiguous":false}},"range":{"units":"touch"},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"level":2,"school":"evo","materials":{"value":"Ruby dust worth 50 gp, which the spell consumes","consumed":true,"cost":50,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"properties":["vocal","somatic","material"],"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"utility","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"override