{"_id":"QvGcdRUSNRKEQJlK","name":"Stone Shape","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"QvGcdRUSNRKEQJlK\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Stone Shape</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>You touch a stone object of Medium size or smaller or a section of stone no more than 5 feet in any dimension and form it into any shape that suits your purpose. So, for example, you could shape a large rock into a weapon, idol, or coffer, or make a small passage through a wall, as long as the wall is less than 5 feet thick. You could also shape a stone door or its frame to seal the door shut. The object you create can have up to two hinges and a latch, but finer mechanical detail isn't possible.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Stone Shape</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 2,500 gp</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Stone Shape</strong></p><p>You touch a stone object of Medium size or smaller or a section of stone no more than 5 feet in any dimension and form it into any shape that suits your purpose. So, for example...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"action","condition":"","value":1},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"target":{"affects":{"type":"object","count":"1","choice":false},"template":{"units":"","contiguous":false}},"range":{"units":"touch"},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"level":4,"school":"trs","materials":{"value":"Soft clay, which must be worked into roughly the desired shape of the stone o