{"_id":"dhqBY4TvVjxVmOZd","name":"Sleet Storm","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"dhqBY4TvVjxVmOZd\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Sleet Storm</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>Until the spell ends, freezing rain and sleet fall in a 20-foot-tall cylinder with a 40-foot radius centered on a point you choose within range. The area is heavily obscured, and exposed flames in the area are doused.</p><p>The ground in the area is covered with slick ice, making it difficult terrain. When a creature enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, it must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, it falls Prone.</p><p>If a creature is concentrating in the spell's area, the creature must make a successful Constitution saving throw against your spell save DC or lose concentration.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Sleet Storm</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 500 gp</li><li>Activities: Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Sleet Storm</strong></p><p>Until the spell ends, freezing rain and sleet fall in a 20-foot-tall cylinder with a 40-foot radius centered on a point you choose within range. The area is heavily obscured, an...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"action","condition":"","value":1},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"minute"},"target":{"affects":{"choice":false},"template":{"units":"ft","type":"cylinder","size":"40","contiguous":false}},"range":{"value":"150","units":"ft"},"uses":{"m