{"_id":"eEpy1ONlXumKS1mp","name":"Dominate Monster","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"eEpy1ONlXumKS1mp\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Dominate Monster</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>You attempt to beguile a creature that you can see within range. It must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be &amp;Reference[charmed] by you for the duration. If you or creatures that are friendly to you are fighting it, it has advantage on the saving throw.</p><p>While the creature is charmed, you have a telepathic link with it as long as the two of you are on the same plane of existence. You can use this telepathic link to issue commands to the creature while you are conscious (no action required), which it does its best to obey. You can specify a simple and general course of action, such as \"Attack that creature,\" \"Run over there,\" or \"Fetch that object.\" If the creature completes the order and doesn't receive further direction from you, it defends and preserves itself to the best of its ability.</p><p>You can use your action to take total and precise control of the target. Until the end of your next turn, the creature takes only the actions you choose, and doesn't do anything that you don't allow it to do. During this time, you can also cause the creature to use a reaction, but this requires you to use your own reaction as well.</p><p>Each time the target takes damage, it makes a new Wisdom saving throw against the spell. If the saving throw succeeds, the spell ends.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you cast this spell with a 9th-level spell slot, the duration is concentration, up to 8 hours.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Dominate Monster</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 50,000 gp</li><li>Activities: Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Dominate Monster</strong></p><p>You attempt to beguile a creature that you can see within range. It must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be &amp;Reference[charmed] by you for the duration. If you or creatures...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"action","condition":"","value":1},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"hour"},"target":{"affects":{"type":"creature","count":"1","choice":false},"template":{"units":"","contiguous":false}},"range":{"value":"60","units":"ft"},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"level":8,"school":"enc","materials":{"value":"","consumed":false,"cost":0,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"properties":["vocal","somatic","concentration"],"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"save","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"override":false,"condition":""},"consumption":{"targets":[],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Cast Dominate Monster; resolve the target save."},"duration":{"units":"inst","concentration":false,"override":false,"value":"","special":""},"effects":[],"range":{"override":false,"units":"self","special":""},"target":{"prompt":true,"template":{"contiguous":false,"units":"ft","count":"","type":"","size":"","width":"","height":""},"affects":{"choice":false,"count":"","type":"","special":""},"override":false},"damage":{"onSave":"half","parts":[]},"save":{"ability":"wis","dc":{"calculation":"spellcasting","formula":""}},"uses":{"spent":0,"recovery":[],"max":""},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionText":"","isOverTimeFlag":false,"otherActivityId":"none","roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":false},"macroData":{"name":"","command":""},"ignoreTraits":{"idi":false,"idr":false,"idv":false,"ida":false},"midiProperties":{"ignoreTraits":[],"triggeredActivityId":"none","triggeredActivityConditionText":"","triggeredActivityTargets":"targets","triggeredActivityRollAs":"self","forceDialog":false,"confirmTargets":"default","autoTargetType":"any","autoTargetAction":"default","automationOnly":false,"otherActivityCompatible":true,"identifier":"","displayActivityName":false,"rollMode":"default","chooseEffects":false,"toggleEffect":false,"ignoreFullCover":false},"overTimeProperties":{"saveRemoves":true,"preRemoveConditionText":"","postRemoveConditionText":""}}},"identifier":"dominate-monster","price":{"value":50000,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"veryRare","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"eEpy1ONlXumKS1mp\"><p><em>An inscribed spell formula awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This inscribed spell formula is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. It carries the kind of presence that makes casual appraisal feel inadequate.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Inscribed Spell Formula</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"}},"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.eEpy1ONlXumKS1mp"},"midi-qol":{"rollAttackPerTarget":"default","removeAttackDamageButtons":"default","effectActivation":false,"itemCondition":"","reactionCondition":"","otherCondition":"","effectCondition":""},"dae":{"disableIncapacitated":false,"selfTarget":true,"selfTargetAlways":true,"dontApply":false,"stackable":"noneName","showIcon":true,"durationExpression":"","macroRepeat":"none","specialDuration":[]},"midiProperties":{"confirmTargets":"default","autoFailFriendly":false,"autoSaveFriendly":false,"critOther":false,"offHandWeapon":false,"magicdam":false,"magiceffect":false,"concentration":false,"noConcentrationCheck":false,"toggleEffect":false,"ignoreTotalCover":false},"infinity-dnd5e":{"keywords":["activation.action","automation.activity","automation.activity.save","automation.mode.usable","curation.high","economy.sellable","folder.family.spells","folder.path.spells.level-8","folder.section.level-8","foundryType.spell","loot","loot.spell","magic.bonus","merchant.arcana","merchant.magic","merchant.spell","price.gp","prop.concentration","prop.somatic","prop.vocal","rarity.very-rare","sale.specialty","source.class.curated","source.curated","source.dnd5e.spells","source.party.operations.party.operations.loot.manifest","source.policy.normal","spell.concentration","spell.level.8","spell.school.enc","tier.t4","value.high","value.v5","weight.none"],"lootType":"loot.spell","tier":"tier.t4","rarityNormalized":"very-rare","gpValue":50000,"valueBand":"value.v5","taggedAt":"2026-04-20T00:02:30.081Z","tagSchema":"po-loot-v3","details":{"schema":"po-item-enrichment-v3","itemType":"spell","activityCount":1,"effectCount":0,"hasDescription":true,"coreSourceId":"Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.eEpy1ONlXumKS1mp","folderPathKey":"spells/level-8","folderLabels":["Spells","Level 8"],"primaryMode":"usable","activityTypes":["save"],"activationTypes":["action"],"transferEffectCount":0,"appliedEffectCount":0},"pricingSource":"system","priceDenomination":"gp","merchantCategories":["arcana","magic","spell"],"saleLiquidity":"sale.specialty","lootWeight":0.14,"maxRecommendedQty":1,"lootEligible":true,"sellValueGp":25000,"folder":{"schema":"po-loot-folder-v1","familyKey":"spells","familyLabel":"Spells","sectionKey":"level-8","sectionLabel":"Level 8","leafKey":"","leafLabel":"","path":[{"key":"spells","label":"Spells","sort":4000},{"key":"level-8","label":"Level 8","sort":4180}],"pathLabels":["Spells","Level 8"],"pathKeys":["spells","level-8"],"pathKey":"spells/level-8"},"usability":{"schema":"po-loot-usage-v1","isUsable":true,"primaryMode":"usable","activityCount":1,"activityTypes":["save"],"primaryActivityType":"save","activationTypes":["action"],"targetTypes":[],"effectCount":0,"transferEffectCount":0,"appliedEffectCount":0,"hasPassiveEffects":false,"hasAppliedEffects":false,"integrations":[]},"sourceClass":"curated","sourcePolicy":"normal","curationScore":8,"art":{"schema":"infinity-dnd5e-art-assignment-v1","mode":"bespoke","assetId":"unique/dominate-monster-eEpy1ONlXumKS1mp","plannedPath":"assets/item-art/unique/dominate-monster-eEpy1ONlXumKS1mp.webp","fallbackIcon":"icons/magic/air/air-burst-spiral-large-pink.webp","generated":false},"descriptionState":{"schema":"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1","identified":true,"unidentified":true}}},"img":"icons/magic/air/air-burst-spiral-large-pink.webp","effects":[],"folder":"x1XTiOgx4DJ34wc5","_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"12.331","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.0.0","createdTime":1725037361593,"modifiedTime":1725992721611,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"rarity":"very-rare"}
{"_id":"eGMhwmuleAM46C6L","name":"Prismatic Spray","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"eGMhwmuleAM46C6L\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Prismatic Spray</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>Eight multicolored rays of light flash from your hand. Each ray is a different color and has a different power and purpose. Each creature in a 60-foot cone must make a Dexterity saving throw. For each target, roll a d8 to determine which color ray affects it.</p><ol><li><strong>Red</strong>. The target takes 10d6 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</li><li><strong>Orange</strong>. The target takes 10d6 acid damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</li><li><strong>Yellow</strong>. The target takes 10d6 lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</li><li><strong>Green</strong>. The target takes 10d6 poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</li><li><strong>Blue</strong>. The target takes 10d6 cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</li><li><strong>Indigo</strong>. On a failed save, the target is &amp;Reference[Restrained]. It must then make a Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. If it successfully saves three times, the spell ends. If it fails its save three times, it permanently turns to stone and is subjected to the &amp;Reference[Petrified] condition. The successes and failures don't need to be consecutive; keep track of both until the target collects three of a kind.</li><li><strong>Violet</strong>. On a failed save, the target is &amp;Reference[Blinded]. It must then make a Wisdom saving throw at the start of your next turn. A successful save ends the blindness. If it fails that save, the creature is transported to another plane of existence of the DM's choosing and is no longer Blinded. (Typically, a creature that is on a plane that isn't its home plane is banished home, while other creatures are usually cast into the Astral or Ethereal planes.)</li><li><strong>Special</strong>. The target is struck by two rays. Roll twice more, rerolling any 8.</li></ol></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Prismatic Spray</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 25,000 gp</li><li>Activities: Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Prismatic Spray</strong></p><p>Eight multicolored rays of light flash from your hand. Each ray is a different color and has a different power and purpose. Each creature in a 60-foot cone must make a Dexterity...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"action","condition":"","value":1},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"target":{"affects":{"choice":false},"template":{"units":"ft","type":"cone","size":"60","contiguous":false}},"range":{"units":"self"},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"level":7,"school":"evo","materials":{"value":"","consumed":false,"cost":0,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"properties":["vocal","somatic"],"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"save","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"override":false,"condition":""},"consumption":{"targets":[],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Cast Prismatic Spray; resolve the target save."},"duration":{"units":"inst","concentration":false,"override":false,"value":"","special":""},"effects":[],"range":{"override":false,"units":"self","special