{"_id":"fVbCxFRaORalHB20","name":"Scrying","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"fVbCxFRaORalHB20\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Scrying</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>You can see and hear a particular creature you choose that is on the same plane of existence as you. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw, which is modified by how well you know the target and the sort of physical connection you have to it. If a target knows you're casting this spell, it can fail the saving throw voluntarily if it wants to be observed.</p>\n<table border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Knowledge</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Save Modifier</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secondhand (you have heard of the target)</td>\n<td>+5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Firsthand (you have met the target)</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Familiar (you know the target well)</td>\n<td>-5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<table border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Connection</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Save Modifier</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Likeness or picture</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Possession or garment</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Body part, lock of hair, bit of nail, or the like</td>\n<td>-10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>On a successful save, the target isn't affected, and you can't use this spell against it again for 24 hours.</p><p>On a failed save, the spell creates an Invisible sensor within 10 feet of the target. You can see and hear through the sensor as if you were there. The sensor moves with the target, remaining within 10 feet of it for the Duration. A creature that can see Invisile Objects sees the sensor as a luminous orb about the size of your fist.</p><p>Instead of targeting a creature, you can choose a location you have seen before as the target of this spell. When you do, the sensor appears at that location and doesn't move.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Scrying</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 5,000 gp</li><li>Activities: Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Scrying</strong></p><p>You can see and hear a particular creature you choose that is on the same plane of existence as you. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw, which is modified by how well yo...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"minute","condition":"","value":10},"duration":{"value":"10","units":"minute"},"target":{"affects":{"type":"creature","count":"1","choice":false},"template":{"units":"","contiguous":false}},"range":{"units":"self"},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"level":5,"school":"div","materials":{"value":"A focus worth at least 1,000 gp, such as a crystal ball, a silver mirror, or a font filled with holy water.","consumed":false,"cost":1000,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"properties":["vocal","somatic","material","concentration"],"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"save","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"override":false,"condition":""},"consumption":{"targets":[],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Cast Scrying; resolve the target save."},"duration":{"units":"inst","concentration":false,"override":false,"value":"","special":""},"effects":[],"range":{"override":false,"units":"self","special":""},"target":{"prompt":true,"template":{"contiguous":false,"units":"ft","count":"","type":"","size":"","width":"","height":""},"affects":{"choice":false,"count":"","type":"","special":""},"override":false},"damage":{"onSave":"half","parts":[]},"save":{"ability":"wis","dc":{"calculation":"spellcasting","formula":""}},"uses":{"spent":0,"recovery":[],"max":""},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionText":"","isOverTimeFlag":false,"otherActivityId":"none","roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":false},"macroData":{"name":"","command":""},"ignoreTraits":{"idi":false,"idr":false,"idv":false,"ida":false},"midiProperties":{"ignoreTraits":[],"triggeredActivityId":"none","triggeredActivityConditionText":"","triggeredActivityTargets":"targets","triggeredActivityRollAs":"self","forceDialog":false,"confirmTargets":"default","autoTargetType":"any","autoTargetAction":"default","automationOnly":false,"otherActivityCompatible":true,"identifier":"","displayActivityName":false,"rollMode":"default","chooseEffects":false,"toggleEffect":false,"ignoreFullCover":false},"overTimeProperties":{"saveRemoves":true,"preRemoveConditionText":"","postRemoveConditionText":""}}},"identifier":"scrying","price":{"value":5000,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"rare","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"fVbCxFRaORalHB20\"><p><em>An inscribed spell formula awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This inscribed spell formula is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. The workmanship suggests it deserves careful study before anyone relies on it.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Inscribed Spell Formula</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"}},"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.fVbCxFRaORalHB20"},"midi-qol":{"rollAttackPerTarget":"default","removeA