{"_id":"hDOENzjuj5WpLq7B","name":"Animal Friendship","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"hDOENzjuj5WpLq7B\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Animal Friendship</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>This spell lets you convince a beast that you mean it no harm. Choose a beast that you can see within range. It must see and hear you. If the beast's Intelligence is 4 or higher, the spell fails. Otherwise, the beast must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be charmed by you for the spell's duration. If you or one of your companions harms the target, the spell ends.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you can affect one additional beast for each slot level above 1st.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Animal Friendship</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 50 gp</li><li>Activities: Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Animal Friendship</strong></p><p>This spell lets you convince a beast that you mean it no harm. Choose a beast that you can see within range. It must see and hear you. If the beast&#39;s Intelligence is 4 or higher...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"action","condition":"","value":1},"duration":{"value":"24","units":"hour"},"target":{"affects":{"type":"creature","count":"1","choice":false},"template":{"units":"","contiguous":false}},"range":{"value":"30","units":"ft"},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"level":1,"school":"enc","materials":{"valu