{"_id":"pV04y1iXoWiom6bp","name":"Incendiary Cloud","ownership":{"default":0},"type":"spell","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"pV04y1iXoWiom6bp\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Incendiary Cloud</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A swirling cloud of smoke shot through with white-hot embers appears in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within range. The cloud spreads around corners and is heavily obscured. It lasts for the Duration or until a wind of moderate or greater speed (at least 10 miles per hour) disperses it.</p><p>When the cloud appears, each creature in it must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 10d8 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature must also make this saving throw when it enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there.</p><p>The cloud moves 10 feet directly away from you in a direction that you choose at the start of each of your turns.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Incendiary Cloud</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 50,000 gp</li><li>Activities: Save</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Incendiary Cloud</strong></p><p>A swirling cloud of smoke shot through with white-hot embers appears in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within range. The cloud spreads around corners and is heavily...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"action","condition":"","value":1},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"minute"},"target":{"affects":{"choice":false},"templa