{"_id":"z1mx84ONwkXKUZd7","name":"Shield","type":"spell","img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-glowing-triangle-magenta.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"z1mx84ONwkXKUZd7\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Shield</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>An invisible barrier of magical force appears and protects you. Until the start of your next turn, you have a +5 bonus to AC, including against the triggering attack, and you take no damage from <em>magic missile</em>.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Spell, Shield</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 50 gp</li><li>Activities: Utility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Shield</strong></p><p>A reaction spell that throws up an invisible barrier of force for a +5 bonus to AC until your next turn.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"activation":{"type":"reaction","condition":"Which you take when you are hit by an attack or targeted by the magic missile spell","value":1},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"round"},"target":{"affects":{"type":"self","choice":false},"template":{"units":"","contiguous":false}},"range":{"units":"self"},"uses":{"max":"","recovery":[],"spent":0},"level":1,"school":"abj","materials":{"value":"","consumed":false,"cost":0,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"properties":["vocal","somatic"],"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"utility","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"override":false,"condition":""},"consumption":{"targets":[],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Cast Shield."},"duration":{"units":"inst","concentration":false,"override":false,"value":"","special":""},"effects":[],"range":{"override":false,"units":"self","special":""},"target":{"prompt":true,"template":{"contiguous":false,"units":"ft","count":"","type":"","size":"","width":"","height":""},"affects":{"choice":false,"count":"","type":"","special":""},"override":false},"roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":false},"uses":{"spent":0,"recovery":[],"max":""},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionText":"","isOverTimeFlag":false,"otherActivityId":"none","macroData":{"name":"","command":""},"ignoreTraits":{"idi":false,"idr":false,"idv":false,"ida":false},"midiProperties":{"ignoreTraits":[],"triggeredActivityId":"none","triggeredActivityConditionText":"","triggeredActivityTargets":"targets","triggeredActivityRollAs":"self","forceDialog":false,"confirmTargets":"default","autoTargetType":"any","autoTargetAction":"default","automationOnly":false,"otherActivityCompatible":true,"identifier":"","displayActivityName":false,"rollMode":"default","chooseEffects":false,"toggleEffect":false,"ignoreFullCover":false},"overTimeProperties":{"saveRemoves":true,"preRemoveConditionText":"","postRemoveConditionText":""}}},"identifier":"shield","price":{"value":50,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"common","unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"z1mx84ONwkXKUZd7\"><p><em>An inscribed spell formula awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This inscribed spell formula is described by worked metal, balance, and edge finish. The notation is readable enough to identify the tradition, but not the full working at a glance.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Inscribed Spell Formula</li><li>Inspection c