{"name":"Potion of Giant Size","type":"consumable","_id":"9HEjizGE5QOmkGh9","img":"icons/consumables/potions/bottle-bulb-corked-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"9HEjizGE5QOmkGh9\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Potion of Giant Size</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><h1>Potion of Giant Size</h1><h2>Type: Potion, Rare</h2><p>When consumed, this mystical potion causes the drinker to grow to an enormous size, akin to that of a giant. The transformation lasts for <strong>24 hours</strong>, bestowing the following effects:</p><ul><li><strong>Size Increase:</strong> Your height doubles, and your weight increases eightfold. Your size category becomes Large.</li><li><strong>Reach:</strong> Your reach extends by 5 feet.</li><li><strong>Strength Enhancement:</strong> Your Strength score increases by 6.</li><li><strong>Temporary Hit Points:</strong> You gain temporary hit points equal to your new size's hit point maximum.</li><li><strong>Advantage:</strong> You have advantage on Strength checks and Strength saving throws.</li><li><strong>Carrying Capacity:</strong> Your carrying capacity is multiplied by 8, and your weapons and other carried objects increase in size proportionally.</li></ul><h2>Side Effects</h2><p>Upon the potion's expiration, the following side effects occur:</p><ul><li><strong>Size Reduction:</strong> You shrink back to your original size, and any objects you were carrying return to their normal size.</li><li><strong>Exhaustion:</strong> You suffer one level of exhaustion due to the strain of your body rapidly shrinking.</li><li><strong>Limitations:</strong> Drinking another Potion of Giant Size while under the effects of a previous one has no additional effect and does not extend the duration. The potion can only affect creatures of Medium size or smaller.</li></ul><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-xEVb372jVPXANSQZ\"><p><strong>DM Note:</strong> The specific mechanics of hit point increases, reach, carrying capacity, and size changes follow the rules outlined in the Player's Handbook. The Potion of Giant Size provides a temporary boost to the imbiber's abilities and can be a potent asset in combat and other physical tasks during its duration.</p></section><p><strong>Common Table Ruling:</strong> Automation covers the Strength-facing buff. Size, reach, temporary hit points, and carrying-capacity changes should still be adjudicated at the table.</p><!-- po-ruling:giant-size-ruling --></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Potion</li><li>Rarity: Legendary</li><li>Value: 1,000 pp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Activities: Utility</li><li>Automated effects: 1 applied</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Potion of Giant Size</strong></p><p>Potion of Giant Size Type: Potion, Rare When consumed, this mystical potion causes the drinker to grow to an enormous size, akin to that of a giant. The transformation lasts for...</p>"},"source":{"custom":"","revision":1,"rules":"2014"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":1000,"denomination":"pp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"legendary","identified":true,"activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"day"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":"1","width":null,"units":"","type":"willing","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":1,"max":"1","per":"charges","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"prompt":true,"spent":0},"consume":{"type":"","target":"","amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":"","actionType":"util","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":"","base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"properties":[],"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"9HEjizGE5QOmkGh9\"><p><em>A sealed vial awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This sealed vial is described by sealed glass, color, and residue. It carries the kind of presence that makes casual appraisal feel inadequate.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Sealed Vial</li><li>Inspection cues: sealed glass, color, and residue</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"potion","subtype":""},"attack":{"bonus":"","flat":false},"container":null,"attuned":false,"enchantment":null,"summons":null,"magicalBonus":null,"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"utility","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"condition":"","override":false},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Drink the Potion of Giant Size."},"duration":{"concentration":false,"value":"1","units":"day","special":"","override":false},"effects":[{"_id":"d58a95f637f0f257"}],"range":{"units":"touch","special":"","override":false},"target":{"template":{"count":"","contiguous":false,"type":"","size":"","width":"","height":"","units":"ft"},"affects":{"count":"1","type":"willing","choice":false,"special":""},"prompt":true,"override":false},"uses":{"spent":0,"max":"","recovery":[]},"roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":false},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionTex