{"_id":"oonj8jajRaN6cKw4","name":"Bloodstone Cabochon","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/gems/gem-faceted-rounded-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"oonj8jajRaN6cKw4\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Bloodstone Cabochon</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A polished bloodstone cabochon cut shallow enough to show dark green stone veined in dried-blood red.</p><p>Jewelers favor pieces like this for signets, devotional charms, and grim trophies because the mottling reads well even by candlelight.</p><p>Display: Small polished cabochon. Weight: 0.05 lb.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure, Treasure</li><li>Value: 50 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Bloodstone Cabochon</strong></p><p>A polished bloodstone cabochon cut shallow enough to show dark green stone veined in dried-blood red. Jewelers favor pieces like this for signets, devotional charms, and grim tr...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1,"custom":"Party Operations Curated Treasure"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0.05,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":50,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"type":{"value":"treasure","subtype":""},"identifier":"bloodstone-cabochon","activities":{},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"oonj8jajRaN6cKw4\"><p><em>A cut stone awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This cut stone is described by faceted surfaces and reflected light. Its practical use is appa