{"_id":"XBUOsrwthY205zro","name":"Silver Filigree Mask","type":"loot","img":"modules/infinity-dnd5e/assets/item-art/unique/silver-filigree-mask-XBUOsrwthY205zro.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"XBUOsrwthY205zro\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Silver Filigree Mask</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A ceremonial silver mask chased with knotwork so fine it looks spun rather than carved.</p><p>It was made for procession, altar display, or masquerade pageantry, not battlefield use, and still carries the austere poise of formal ritual.</p><p>Display: Ceremonial face mask. Weight: 3 lb.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure, Treasure</li><li>Value: 250 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Silver Filigree Mask</strong></p><p>A ceremonial silver mask chased with knotwork so fine it looks spun rather than carved. It was made for procession, altar display, or masquerade pageantry, not battlefield use,...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1,"custom":"Party Operations Curated Treasure"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":3,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":250,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"type":{"value":"treasure","subtype":""},"identifier":"silver-filigree-mask","activities":{},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"XBUOsrwthY205zro\"><p><em>A crafted art object awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This crafted art object is described by craftsmanship, condi