{"_id":"Yi1mpvrq1AOFQHvy","name":"Bronze Astral Orrery","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/tech/astrolabe-brass.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"Yi1mpvrq1AOFQHvy\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Bronze Astral Orrery</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A finely geared bronze orrery engraved with star names, eclipse marks, and narrow rings for the known planets.</p><p>Even motionless, it reads as the prize possession of an observatory, admiral, or court astrologer who needed equal measures of science and vanity.</p><p>Display: Tabletop astronomical instrument. Weight: 15 lb.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure, Treasure</li><li>Value: 2,500 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Bronze Astral Orrery</strong></p><p>A finely geared bronze orrery engraved with star names, eclipse marks, and narrow rings for the known planets. Even motionless, it reads as the prize possession of an observator...</p>"},"source":{"rules":"2014","revision":1,"custom":"Party Operations Curated Treasure"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":15,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":2500,"denomination":"gp"},"rarity":"","identified":true,"type":{"value":"treasure","subtype":""},"identifier":"bronze-astral-orrery","activities":{},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"Yi1mpvrq1AOFQHvy\"><p><em>A crafted art object awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This crafted art object is described by craftsmanship, condi