{"_id":"Vuv2p5m298FAvG2h","name":"Painted Siege Map Scroll","type":"loot","img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-map-plain-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"Vuv2p5m298FAvG2h\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Painted Siege Map Scroll</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A long painted scroll showing a fortified city, siege lines, and careful notes in a commander&#39;s hand.</p><p>It is useful as decoration even if the battle it records has been forgotten, because strategy ages into art surprisingly well.</p><p>Display: Illustrated campaign scroll. Weight: 3 lb.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure, Treasure</li><li>Value: 500 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Painted Siege Map Scroll</strong></p><p>A long painted scroll showing a fortified city, siege lines, and careful notes in a commander&#39;s hand. It is useful as decoration even if the battle it records has been forgotten...</p>"},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"Vuv2p5m298FAvG2h\"><p><em>A crafted art object awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This crafted art object is described by paper stock, ink, and binding. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Crafted Art Object</li><li>Inspection cues: paper stock, ink, and binding</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"sour