{"_id":"Zg3c4Czps3dzjz4g","name":"Ivory Admiral Bust","type":"loot","img":"icons/commodities/treasure/statue-carved-figurehead.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"Zg3c4Czps3dzjz4g\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Ivory Admiral Bust</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A carved ivory bust of a severe naval commander, complete with braided collar, storm cloak, and a stare aimed just above the viewer.</p><p>It was made to sit in an office, war room, or gallery where authority mattered as much as decoration.</p><p>Display: Cabinet-sized portrait bust. Weight: 9 lb.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure, Treasure</li><li>Value: 2,500 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Ivory Admiral Bust</strong></p><p>A carved ivory bust of a severe naval commander, complete with braided collar, storm cloak, and a stare aimed just above the viewer. It was made to sit in an office, war room, o...</p>"},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"Zg3c4Czps3dzjz4g\"><p><em>A crafted art object awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This crafted art object is described by craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks. Small details imply more value than a quick glance can confirm.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Crafted Art Object</li><li>Inspection cues: craftsmanship, condition, and hidden marks</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"source":{"rules":"2