{"_id":"xsxWVCEmIANmhiVn","name":"Silk Eclipse Banner","type":"loot","img":"icons/sundries/flags/banner-symbol-sword-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"xsxWVCEmIANmhiVn\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Silk Eclipse Banner</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A narrow silk banner embroidered with a black sun crossing a gilt ring and edged with disciplined rows of silver thread.</p><p>Even rolled, it reads as temple or court property rather than common cloth, the kind of piece meant to appear only on important days.</p><p>Display: Embroidered ceremonial banner. Weight: 4 lb.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Treasure, Treasure</li><li>Value: 750 gp</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Silk Eclipse Banner</strong></p><p>A narrow silk banner embroidered with a black sun crossing a gilt ring and edged with disciplined rows of silver thread. Even rolled, it reads as temple or court property rather...</p>"},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"xsxWVCEmIANmhiVn\"><p><em>A crafted art object awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This crafted art object is described by worked metal, balance, and edge finish. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and special details still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Crafted Art Object</li><li>Inspection cues: worked metal, balance, and edge finish</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></u