{"_id":"JlaY9vXuw8ni4Toy","name":"Spell Scroll: Light","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-orange-tan.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"JlaY9vXuw8ni4Toy\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Light</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Light (cantrip evo).</p><hr /><p>You touch one object that is no larger than 10 feet in any dimension. Until the spell ends, the object sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius and dim light for an additional 20 feet. The light can be colored as you like. Completely covering the object with something opaque blocks the light. The spell ends if you cast it again or dismiss it as an action.</p><p>If you target an object held or worn by a hostile creature, that creature must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw to avoid the spell.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 10 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Light</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Light</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Light, a cantrip spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":10,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"JlaY9vXuw8ni4Toy\"><p><em>A sealed scroll awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This sealed scroll is described by paper stock, ink, and binding. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and spell formula still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Sealed Scroll</li><li>Inspection cues: paper stock, ink, and binding</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"scroll","subtype":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"save","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"override":false,"condition":"Spell must be on the caster's spell list."},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Cast Light from a spell scroll."},"duration":{"units":"inst","concentration":false,"override":false,"value":"","special":""},"effects":[],"range":{"override":false,"units":"self","special":""},"target":{"prompt":true,"template":{"contiguous":false,"units":"ft","count":"","type":"","size":"","width":"","height":""},"affects":{"choice":false,"count":"","type":"","special":""},"override":false},"damage":{"onSave":"none","parts":[]},"save":{"ability":"dex","dc":{"calculation":"spellcasting","formula":""}