{"_id":"p57jMcFgQWFx5b6t","name":"Spell Scroll: Resistance","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-orange-tan.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"p57jMcFgQWFx5b6t\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Resistance</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Resistance (cantrip abj).</p><hr /><p>You touch one willing creature. Once before the spell ends, the target can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to one saving throw of its choice. It can roll the die before or after making the saving throw. The spell then ends.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 10 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Resistance</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Resistance</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Resistance, a cantrip spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":10,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"uses