{"_id":"qRD6GzDbVPLnz2st","name":"Spell Scroll: Spare the Dying","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-orange-tan.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"qRD6GzDbVPLnz2st\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Spare the Dying</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Spare the Dying (cantrip nec).</p><hr /><p>You touch a living creature that has 0 hit points. The creature becomes stable. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 10 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Spare the Dying</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Spare the Dying</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Spare the Dying, a cantrip spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":10,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"