{"_id":"WS5on7MqTCoFtywu","name":"Spell Scroll: Comprehend Languages","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-orange-tan.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"WS5on7MqTCoFtywu\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Comprehend Languages</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Comprehend Languages (1st-level div).</p><hr /><p>For the duration, you understand the literal meaning of any spoken language that you hear. You also understand any written language that you see, but you must be touching the surface on which the words are written. It takes about 1 minute to read one page of text.</p><p>This spell doesn't decode secret messages in a text or a glyph, such as an arcane sigil, that isn't part of a written language.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 60 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Comprehend Languages</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Comprehend Languages</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Comprehend Languages, a 1st-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book