{"_id":"NotWSesL9mHE3l4l","name":"Spell Scroll: Fog Cloud","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-orange-tan.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"NotWSesL9mHE3l4l\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Fog Cloud</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Fog Cloud (1st-level con).</p><hr /><p>You create a 20-foot-radius Sphere of fog centered on a point within range. The sphere spreads around corners, and its area is heavily obscured. It lasts for the Duration or until a wind of moderate or greater speed (at least 10 miles per hour) disperses it.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the radius of the fog increases by 20 feet for each slot level above 1st.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 60 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Fog Cloud</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Fog Cloud</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Fog Cloud, a 1st-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","