{"_id":"8xO4Rj22VxJ7LNSh","name":"Spell Scroll: Purify Food and Drink","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-orange-tan.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"8xO4Rj22VxJ7LNSh\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Purify Food and Drink</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Purify Food and Drink (1st-level trs).</p><hr /><p>All nonmagical food and drink within a 5-foot-radius sphere centered on a point of your choice within range is purified and rendered free of poison and disease.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Common</li><li>Value: 60 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Purify Food and Drink</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Purify Food and Drink</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Purify Food and Drink, a 1st-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":60,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"common","identified":true,"u