{"_id":"9wVrsLFzZoGOQg6D","name":"Spell Scroll: Misty Step","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-gold-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"9wVrsLFzZoGOQg6D\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Misty Step</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Misty Step (2nd-level con).</p><hr /><p>Briefly surrounded by silvery mist, you teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space that you can see.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 120 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Misty Step</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Misty Step</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Misty Step, a 2nd-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":120,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"type