{"_id":"UYBYeY9m0yL4qCji","name":"Spell Scroll: Scorching Ray","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-gold-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"UYBYeY9m0yL4qCji\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Scorching Ray</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Scorching Ray (2nd-level evo).</p><hr /><p>You create three rays of fire and hurl them at targets within range. You can hurl them at one target or several.</p><p>Make a ranged Spell Attack for each ray. On a hit, the target takes 2d6 fire damage.</p><p><strong>Higher Levels.</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, you create one additional ray for each slot level above 2nd.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 120 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Scorching Ray</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Scorching Ray</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Scorching Ray, a 2nd-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revisio