{"_id":"ryvnNSgTOMS7ZucC","name":"Spell Scroll: Bestow Curse","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-gold-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"ryvnNSgTOMS7ZucC\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Bestow Curse</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Bestow Curse (3rd-level nec).</p><hr /><p>You touch a creature, and that creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become cursed for the duration of the spell. When you cast this spell, choose the nature of the curse from the following options:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Choose one ability score. While cursed, the target has disadvantage on ability checks and saving throws made with that ability score.</li>\n<li>While cursed, the target has disadvantage on attack rolls against you.</li>\n<li>While cursed, the target must make a Wisdom saving throw at the start of each of its turns. If it fails, it wastes its action that turn doing nothing.</li>\n<li>While the target is cursed, your attacks and spells deal an extra 1d8 necrotic damage to the target.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A remove curse spell ends this effect. At the DM's option, you may choose an alternative curse effect, but it should be no more powerful than those described above. The DM has final say on such a curse's effect.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> If you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the duration is concentration, up to 10 minutes. If you use a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the duration is 8 hours. If you use a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the duration is 24 hours. If you use a 9th level spell slot, the spell lasts until it is dispelled. Using a spell slot of 5th level or higher grants a duration that doesn't require concentration.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 200 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Bestow Curse</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Bestow Curse</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Bestow Curse, a 3rd-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":200,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"ryvnNSgTOMS7ZucC\"><p><em>A sealed scroll awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This sealed scroll is described by paper stock, ink, and binding. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and spell formula still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Sealed Scroll</li><li>Inspection cues: paper stock, ink, and binding</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"scroll","subtype":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"save","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"override":false,"condition":"Spell must be on the caster's spell list."},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Cast Bestow Curse from a spell scroll."},"duration":{"units":"inst","concentration":false,"override":false,"value":"","special":""},"effects":[],"range":{"override":false,"units":"self","special":""},"target":{"prompt":true,"template":{"contiguous":false,"units":"ft","count":"","type":"","size":"","width":"","height":""},"affects":{"choice":false,"count":"","type":"","special":""},"override":false},"damage":{"onSave":"half","parts":[]},"save":{"ability":"wis","dc":{"calculation":"spellcasting","formula":""}},"uses":{"spent":0,"recovery":[],"max":""},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionText":"","isOverTimeFlag":false,"otherActivityId":"none","roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":false},"macroData":{"name":"","command":""},"ignoreTraits":{"idi":false,"idr":false,"idv":false,"ida":false},"midiProperties":{"ignoreTraits":[],"triggeredActivityId":"none","triggeredActivityConditionText":"","triggeredActivityTargets":"targets","triggeredActivityRollAs":"self","forceDialog":false,"confirmTargets":"default","autoTargetType":"any","autoTargetAction":"default","automationOnly":false,"otherActivityCompatible":true,"identifier":"","displayActivityName":false,"rollMode":"default","chooseEffects":false,"toggleEffect":false,"ignoreFullCover":false},"overTimeProperties":{"saveRemoves":true,"preRemoveConditionText":"","postRemoveConditionText":""}}},"identifier":"spell-scroll-bestow-curse","container":null,"attuned":false,"magicalBonus":null,"properties":[]},"effects":[],"fold