{"_id":"dcKndDcccsw26KVo","name":"Spell Scroll: Major Image","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-gold-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"dcKndDcccsw26KVo\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Major Image</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Major Image (3rd-level ill).</p><hr /><p>You create the image of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon that is no larger than a 20-foot cube. The image appears at a spot that you can see within range and lasts for the duration. It seems completely real, including sounds, smells, and temperature appropriate to the thing depicted. You can't create sufficient heat or cold to cause damage, a sound loud enough to deal thunder damage or deafen a creature, or a smell that might sicken a creature (like a troglodyte's stench).</p><p>As long as you are within range of the illusion, you can use your action to cause the image to move to any other spot within range. As the image changes location, you can alter its appearance so that its movements appear natural for the image. For example, if you create an image of a creature and move it, you can alter the image so that it appears to be walking. Similarly, you can cause the illusion to make different sounds at different times, even making it carry on a conversation, for example.</p><p>Physical interaction with the image reveals it to be an illusion, because things can pass through it. A creature that uses its action to examine the image can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence (Investigation) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through the image, and its other sensory qualities become faint to the creature.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the spell lasts until dispelled, without requiring your concentration.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 200 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Major Image</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Major Image</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Major Image, a 3rd-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":200,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"dcKndDcccsw26KVo\"><p><em>A sealed scroll awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This sealed scroll is described by paper stock, ink, and binding. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and spell formula still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Sealed Scroll</li><li>Inspection cues: paper stock, ink, and binding</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"scroll","subtype":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"utility","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"override":false,"condition":"Spell must be on the caster's spell list."},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Cast Major Image from a spell scroll."},"duration":{"units":"inst","concentration":false,"override":false,"value":"","special":""},"effects":[],"range":{"override":false,"units":"self","special":""},"target":{"prompt":true,"template":{"contiguous":false,"units":"ft","count":"","type":"","size":"","width":"","height":""},"affects":{"choice":false,"count":"","type":"","special":""},"override":false},"roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":false},"uses":{"spent":0,"recovery":[],"max":""},"sort":0,"useConditionText":"","useConditionReason":"","effectConditionText":"","isOverTimeFlag":false,"otherActivityId":"none","macroData":{"name":"","command":""},"ignoreTraits":{"idi":false,"idr":false,"idv":false,"ida":false},"midiProperties":{"ignoreTraits":[],"triggeredActivityId":"none","triggeredActivityConditionText":"","triggeredActivityTargets":"targets","triggeredActivityRollAs":"self","forceDialog":false,"confirmTargets":"default","autoTargetType":"any","autoTargetAction":"default","automationOnly":false,"otherActivityCompatible":true,"identifier":"","displayActivityName":false,"rollMode":"default","chooseEffects":false,"toggleEffect":false,"ignoreFullCover":false},"overTimeProperties":{"saveRemoves":true,"preRemoveConditionText":"","postRemoveConditionText":""}}},"identifier":"spell-scroll-major-image