{"_id":"PloXKZeH4kVQMlzj","name":"Spell Scroll: Protection from Energy","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-gold-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"PloXKZeH4kVQMlzj\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Protection from Energy</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Protection from Energy (3rd-level abj).</p><hr /><p>For the duration, the willing creature you touch has resistance to one damage type of your choice: acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 200 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Protection from Energy</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Protection from Energy</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Protection from Energy, a 3rd-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":200,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"uses":{"ma