{"_id":"D76a3Z4WGfPvAw3z","name":"Spell Scroll: Remove Curse","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-gold-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"D76a3Z4WGfPvAw3z\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Remove Curse</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Remove Curse (3rd-level abj).</p><hr /><p>At your touch, all curses affecting one creature or object end. If the object is a cursed magic item, its curse remains, but the spell breaks its owner's Attunement to the object so it can be removed or discarded.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 200 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Remove Curse</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Remove Curse</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Remove Curse, a 3rd-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":200,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":tr