{"_id":"B968NOWDuNpXA0ar","name":"Spell Scroll: Water Walk","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-gold-brown.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"B968NOWDuNpXA0ar\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Water Walk</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Water Walk (3rd-level trs).</p><hr /><p>This spell grants the ability to move across any liquid surface—such as water, acid, mud, snow, quicksand, or lava—as if it were harmless solid ground (creatures crossing molten lava can still take damage from the heat). Up to ten willing creatures you can see within range gain this ability for the duration.</p><p>If you target a creature submerged in a liquid, the spell carries the target to the surface of the liquid at a rate of 60 feet per round.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Uncommon</li><li>Value: 200 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Water Walk</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Water Walk</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Water Walk, a 3rd-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":200,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"uncommon","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"B968NOWDuNpXA0ar\"><p><em>A sealed scroll awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This sealed scroll is described by paper stock, ink, and binding. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and spell formula still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Sealed Scroll</li><li>Inspection cues: paper stock, ink, and binding</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"scroll","subtype":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"utility","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"override":false,"condition":"Spell must be on the caster's spell list."},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Cast Water Walk from a spell scroll."},"duration":{"units":"inst","concentration":false,"override":false,"value":"","special":""},"effects":[],"range":{"override":false,"units":"self","special":""},"target":{"prompt":true,"template":{"contiguous":false,"units":"ft","count":"","type":"","size":"","width":"","height":""},"affects":{"choice":false,"count":"","type":"","special":""},"override":false},"roll":{"formula":"","name":"","prompt":false,"visible":false},"uses":{"spent":0,"recovery":[],"max":""},