{"_id":"8pWAYXxBMRWtP3DL","name":"Spell Scroll: Greater Invisibility","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-plain-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"8pWAYXxBMRWtP3DL\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Greater Invisibility</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Greater Invisibility (4th-level ill).</p><hr /><p>You or a creature you touch becomes Invisible until the spell ends. Anything the target is wearing or carrying is Invisible as long as it is on the target's person.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 320 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Greater Invisibility</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Greater Invisibility</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Greater Invisibility, a 4th-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":320,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"uses":{"max"