{"_id":"SVDuXcR4tKFzHAbw","name":"Spell Scroll: Wall of Fire","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-plain-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"SVDuXcR4tKFzHAbw\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Wall of Fire</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Wall of Fire (4th-level evo).</p><hr /><p>You create a wall of fire on a solid surface within range. You can make the wall up to 60 feet long, 20 feet high, and 1 foot thick, or a ringed wall up to 20 feet in diameter, 20 feet high, and 1 foot thick. The wall is opaque and lasts for the duration.</p><p>When the wall appears, each creature within its area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 5d8 fire damage, or half as much damage on a successful save.</p><p>One side of the wall, selected by you when you cast this spell, deals 5d8 fire damage to each creature that ends its turn within 10 feet of that side or inside the wall. A creature takes the same damage when it enters the wall for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there. The other side of the wall deals no damage.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 4th.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 320 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Wall of Fire</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Wall of Fire</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Wall of Fire, a 4th-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014","revision":1},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":320,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":"","equipped":false,"rarity":"rare","identified":true,"uses":{"max":"1","recovery":[],"autoDestroy":true,"spent":0},"damage":{"base":{"number":null,"denomination":null,"types":[],"custom":{"enabled":false},"scaling":{"number":1}},"replace":false},"unidentified":{"description":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--unidentified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"unidentified\" data-item-id=\"SVDuXcR4tKFzHAbw\"><p><em>A sealed scroll awaiting identification.</em></p><p>This sealed scroll is described by paper stock, ink, and binding. Its practical use is apparent, but exact value and spell formula still need inspection.</p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Visible form: Sealed Scroll</li><li>Inspection cues: paper stock, ink, and binding</li><li>Identification state: Unidentified</li></ul></section>"},"type":{"value":"scroll","subtype":""},"activities":{"dnd5eactivity000":{"_id":"dnd5eactivity000","type":"save","activation":{"type":"action","value":1,"override":false,"condition":"Spell must be on the caster's spell list."},"consumption":{"targets":[{"type":"itemUses","target":"","value":"1","scaling":{"mode":"","formula":""}}],"scaling":{"allowed":false,"max":""},"spellSlot":true},"description":{"chatFlavor":"Cast Wall of Fire f