{"_id":"y5zCdfQqNzoeXrGC","name":"Spell Scroll: Greater Restoration","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-plain-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"y5zCdfQqNzoeXrGC\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Greater Restoration</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Greater Restoration (5th-level abj).</p><hr /><p>You imbue a creature you touch with positive energy to undo a debilitating effect. You can reduce the target's Exhaustion level by one, or end one of the following Effects on the target:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>One effect that Charmed or Petrified the target</li>\n<li>One curse, including the target's Attunement to a cursed magic item</li>\n<li>Any reduction to one of the target's Ability Scores</li>\n<li>One effect reducing the target's hit point maximum</li>\n</ul></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Rare</li><li>Value: 640 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Greater Restoration</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Greater Restoration</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Greater Restoration, a 5th-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom"