{"_id":"d4n5NZKCkNk3Hlhx","name":"Spell Scroll: Heal","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-sealed-red-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"d4n5NZKCkNk3Hlhx\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Heal</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Heal (6th-level evo).</p><hr /><p>Choose a creature that you can see within range. A surge of positive energy washes through the creature, causing it to regain 70 Hit Points. This spell also ends blindness, deafness, and any Diseases affecting the target. This spell has no effect on constructs or Undead.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the amount of Healing increases by 10 for each slot level above 6th.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 1,280 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Heal</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Heal</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Heal, a 6th-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"