{"_id":"BZFZkyq4TbwKx86Q","name":"Spell Scroll: Arcane Sword","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-sealed-red-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"BZFZkyq4TbwKx86Q\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Arcane Sword</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Arcane Sword (7th-level evo).</p><hr /><p>You create a sword-shaped plane of force that hovers within range. It lasts for the Duration.</p><p>When the sword appears, you make a melee spell Attack against a target of your choice within 5 feet of the sword. On a hit, the target takes 3d10 force damage. Until the spell ends, you can use a Bonus Action on each of your turns to move the sword up to 20 feet to a spot you can see and repeat this Attack against the same target or a different one.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 2,560 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Arcane Sword</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Arcane Sword</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Arcane Sword, a 7th-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated sp