{"_id":"YxMvA5VVyz8yLGyz","name":"Spell Scroll: Finger of Death","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-sealed-red-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"YxMvA5VVyz8yLGyz\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Finger of Death</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Finger of Death (7th-level nec).</p><hr /><p>You send negative energy coursing through a creature that you can see within range, causing it searing pain. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. It takes 7d8 + 30 necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</p><p>A humanoid killed by this spell rises at the start of your next turn as a Zombie that is permanently under your command, following your verbal orders to the best of its ability.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 2,560 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Finger of Death</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Finger of Death</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Finger of Death, a 7th-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generat