{"_id":"B9I8lVnKaPaCrTbi","name":"Spell Scroll: Regenerate","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-sealed-red-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"B9I8lVnKaPaCrTbi\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Regenerate</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Regenerate (7th-level trs).</p><hr /><p>You touch a creature and stimulate its natural Healing ability. The target regains 4d8 + 15 Hit Points. For the Duration of the spell, the target regains 1 hit point at the start of each of its turns (10 hit points each minute).</p><p>The target's severed body members (fingers, legs, tails, and so on), if any, are restored after 2 minutes. If you have the severed part and hold it to the stump, the spell instantaneously causes the limb to knit to the stump.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 2,560 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Regenerate</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Regenerate</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Regenerate, a 7th-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell