{"_id":"jKFb5KkxUWIlv2NK","name":"Spell Scroll: Power Word Stun","type":"consumable","img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-bound-sealed-red-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<section class=\"infinity-item-description infinity-item-description--identified\" data-schema=\"infinity-dnd5e-description-state-v1\" data-identification-state=\"identified\" data-item-id=\"jKFb5KkxUWIlv2NK\"><header class=\"infinity-item-state-header\"><p><strong>Identified State:</strong> Spell Scroll: Power Word Stun</p></header><div class=\"infinity-item-body\" data-content=\"rules\"><p>A spell scroll bears the words of a single spell, written in a mystical cipher. If the spell is on your class's spell list, you can read the scroll and cast its spell without providing any material components. Otherwise, the scroll is unintelligible. Casting the spell by reading the scroll requires the spell's normal casting time. Once the spell is cast, the words on the scroll fade, and it crumbles to dust.</p><p><strong>Stored Spell:</strong> Power Word Stun (8th-level enc).</p><hr /><p>You speak a word of power that can overwhelm the mind of one creature you can see within range, leaving it dumbfounded. If the target has 150 Hit Points or fewer, it is &amp;Reference[Stunned]. Otherwise, the spell has no effect.</p><p>The stunned target must make a Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a successful save, this stunning effect ends.</p></div><aside class=\"infinity-item-state\" data-content=\"metadata\"><p><strong>Item State</strong></p><ul class=\"infinity-item-state-list\"><li>Consumable, Scroll</li><li>Rarity: Very Rare</li><li>Value: 5,120 gp</li><li>1 use(s)</li><li>Stored spell: Power Word Stun</li></ul></aside></section>","chat":"<p><strong>Spell Scroll: Power Word Stun</strong></p><p>A consumable spell scroll containing Power Word Stun, a 8th-level spell.</p>"},"source":{"custom":"Infinity D&D5e generated spell scroll","book":"SRD 5.1","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0